1
00:02:07,330 --> 00:02:14,910
Contact: turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:15,886 --> 00:02:20,165
White. We're looking for a white flower.

3
00:02:36,646 --> 00:02:41,485
Oh no! Not here. Not here!

4
00:02:41,766 --> 00:02:44,485
Have a good look, Cerkutay Bey.

5
00:02:51,846 --> 00:02:55,525
Look here. Does it look like this?

6
00:02:55,966 --> 00:02:58,325
Not this.

7
00:02:58,726 --> 00:03:03,245
-What about this?
-No, no. Not that one either.

8
00:03:04,846 --> 00:03:08,005
Remember, Cerkutay. Remember.

9
00:03:12,686 --> 00:03:18,045
We're digging with a needle, Alaattin
Bey. My sister won't be able to survive.

10
00:03:18,446 --> 00:03:22,405
Do we have another thing to
do, Mehmed Bey? I told you.

11
00:03:22,606 --> 00:03:26,685
I tried everything, but it
didn't work. We have to find it.

12
00:03:27,206 --> 00:03:31,845
We need to look faster. Come on!

13
00:03:38,966 --> 00:03:42,245
It looked like this. Like this.

14
00:03:42,566 --> 00:03:46,645
Like this. Not exactly this.
Something with more flowers.

15
00:03:46,886 --> 00:03:51,845
I know it from my childhood.
They said it could heal everything.

16
00:03:53,806 --> 00:03:56,565
You are talking about heliotrope.

17
00:03:56,846 --> 00:04:01,765
It's heliotrope. We can find it around here.

18
00:04:02,246 --> 00:04:05,445
Split up now. Meet me near the horses later.

19
00:04:05,646 --> 00:04:09,245
You say that's the heal? My sister will live.

20
00:04:10,046 --> 00:04:12,485
She will live, with Allah's will.

21
00:04:13,966 --> 00:04:17,524
We will find it. We will.

22
00:04:17,685 --> 00:04:22,845
If you hadn't shot that dog, none
of these would have happened.

23
00:04:25,406 --> 00:04:29,045
You are the reason why they tried to kill me,

24
00:04:29,046 --> 00:04:34,285
...why Jandar Bey got killed
and my daughter got shot, Osman!

25
00:04:38,606 --> 00:04:44,085
For years, you have given
this land nothing but suffering.

26
00:04:44,246 --> 00:04:48,325
-You and your house!
-Enough!

27
00:04:54,726 --> 00:04:57,165
Enough, Yakup Bey!

28
00:04:59,686 --> 00:05:04,525
When you ignore the
enemy, they won't disappear!

29
00:05:05,846 --> 00:05:09,725
When you neglect the war
the peace won't be ours!

30
00:05:09,966 --> 00:05:14,525
You blame our own kin for the
every move the enemy makes.

31
00:05:17,486 --> 00:05:19,925
This is enough.

32
00:05:20,966 --> 00:05:25,525
-Osman Bey.
-This is the war of the right and the wrong!

33
00:05:26,926 --> 00:05:31,285
It has been going on for a thousand years
and will continue for a thousand yealrs

34
00:05:33,086 --> 00:05:37,685
And Islam will be the winner of this war.

35
00:05:42,006 --> 00:05:45,205
But you should know this.

36
00:05:45,806 --> 00:05:50,405
I will crush whoever gets in our way.

37
00:05:54,366 --> 00:05:56,965
We will fight Mongolians.

38
00:05:57,606 --> 00:06:00,405
Is your head...

39
00:06:00,806 --> 00:06:05,805
...too heavy for your shoulders?
How dare you talk to me like this?

40
00:06:07,126 --> 00:06:10,405
Stop.

41
00:06:17,086 --> 00:06:21,445
Osman Bey is right!

42
00:06:24,526 --> 00:06:28,085
Osman Bey is right.

43
00:06:31,886 --> 00:06:36,645
Our ancestors escaped from
them and came to this land.

44
00:06:37,166 --> 00:06:43,485
Many generations have been wasted
during the battles and the journey.

45
00:06:47,006 --> 00:06:50,685
We have nowhere else left to go!

46
00:06:54,166 --> 00:06:56,925
Nowhere, Yakup Bey.

47
00:06:58,246 --> 00:07:02,165
It is the war of survival now.

48
00:07:03,526 --> 00:07:09,725
For this reason, Osman Bey is right.

49
00:07:16,086 --> 00:07:19,325
There is no point in blaming Osman Bey.

50
00:07:20,046 --> 00:07:24,565
We should just do what he says.

51
00:07:26,886 --> 00:07:32,445
Being a sultan means listening
to the right man in hard times.

52
00:07:33,606 --> 00:07:36,565
Let's see, Yakup Bey.

53
00:07:53,246 --> 00:07:56,805
I listen to the words of my beys.

54
00:07:58,446 --> 00:08:01,725
What will we do now, Osman Bey?

55
00:08:10,246 --> 00:08:14,205
We will turn these lands
where the beys and alps died...

56
00:08:14,526 --> 00:08:21,325
...into a homeland. And
we will protect them forever.

57
00:08:24,926 --> 00:08:26,325
Let's go.

58
00:08:35,926 --> 00:08:40,804
There some people coming.

59
00:08:42,885 --> 00:08:45,805
What are you doing here, Turks?

60
00:08:51,766 --> 00:08:57,125
You wait. You need to look for the heal.

61
00:08:57,926 --> 00:09:01,245
-My sister will live.
-My Shahzade.

62
00:09:01,326 --> 00:09:04,045
Gokmen, you too.

63
00:09:04,446 --> 00:09:07,725
You can't fight alone, Mehmed Bey.

64
00:09:14,766 --> 00:09:18,965
You can't even imagine what
I can do alone, Alaattin Bey.

65
00:09:19,926 --> 00:09:23,405
Especially what I can do for my sister.

66
00:09:25,366 --> 00:09:30,445
You make people live. I make people die.

67
00:09:30,886 --> 00:09:35,005
-Go!
Let's go.

68
00:09:35,246 --> 00:09:37,685
Come on.

69
00:09:38,926 --> 00:09:42,165
-Come here, dogs.
-Attack!

70
00:10:02,926 --> 00:10:07,765
Alps, take position!

71
00:10:22,406 --> 00:10:23,645
Father!

72
00:10:26,126 --> 00:10:29,685
Let's go, my Bey! Come!

73
00:10:34,366 --> 00:10:38,285
-Father, are you alright?
-I'm good. I'm good.

74
00:10:38,326 --> 00:10:41,085
-You?
-I'm fine, thanks to Allah.

75
00:10:45,526 --> 00:10:47,325
They can't resist.

76
00:10:49,566 --> 00:10:52,845
Shoot, Erlik Khan's nokers!

77
00:10:53,806 --> 00:10:57,645
They're determined to kill us today, my Sultan.

78
00:10:57,686 --> 00:11:01,405
I won't die today until I see my daughter!

79
00:11:01,646 --> 00:11:04,885
-We'll reach the frontier market.
-Yes, we will.

80
00:11:05,006 --> 00:11:06,965
We will, Yakup Bey.

81
00:11:11,766 --> 00:11:17,325
-Konur, attack when the arrows stop.
-As you order, my Bey.

82
00:11:33,566 --> 00:11:37,925
Heliotrope. Found beside briars.

83
00:11:38,046 --> 00:11:42,325
Come on Alaeddin, come
on. Find it already, come on.

84
00:11:42,486 --> 00:11:44,365
Come on.

85
00:12:04,286 --> 00:12:08,205
Come forward you dogs. You
never have enough of dying.

86
00:12:21,686 --> 00:12:25,085
Heliotrope, thank Allah.

87
00:12:25,286 --> 00:12:30,445
Thank Allah. Its heliotrope.

88
00:12:30,926 --> 00:12:36,485
Thank Allah. Thank you my Rabb.

89
00:12:37,046 --> 00:12:42,125
However, it is not enough.
Another, more.

90
00:12:42,286 --> 00:12:45,965
Ya Fattah, Al Fattah.

91
00:12:47,686 --> 00:12:52,445
Thank Allah. Thank you my Rabb.

92
00:12:52,766 --> 00:12:57,085
I will catch up. Hold on a little longer.

93
00:12:57,206 --> 00:13:00,765
-Saadet Hatun.
-Bala, she is burning.

94
00:13:00,846 --> 00:13:03,885
Alaeddin said ice would be
good. The girls got it ready.

95
00:13:03,886 --> 00:13:08,205
Fitnat, Kismet bring the ice.
Quickly now.

96
00:13:08,926 --> 00:13:13,045
-Gonca.
-It just came, we also gave it to others.

97
00:13:13,126 --> 00:13:15,845
Quickly.

98
00:13:22,126 --> 00:13:26,885
Ya Fattah.

99
00:13:32,206 --> 00:13:35,285
What did you resist for? All
of you meet the same end.

100
00:13:38,726 --> 00:13:43,245
-You go after the others.
-You do not know me.

101
00:13:51,766 --> 00:13:56,325
Every second I gain will
help healing my sister.

102
00:13:56,406 --> 00:14:02,445
Hold on a little longer. Thank Allah.

103
00:14:05,966 --> 00:14:09,205
I found it! I found it!

104
00:14:10,166 --> 00:14:13,125
I found it!

105
00:14:13,446 --> 00:14:17,365
-Thank Allah, I've found it!
-Thank Allah.

106
00:14:19,526 --> 00:14:22,965
-Is this it, Cerkutay Bey?
-This is it.

107
00:14:24,526 --> 00:14:29,125
We need to go to the
marketplace quickly, come on.

108
00:14:39,086 --> 00:14:43,805
My Bey, you have poison in your
blood, and Yakup Bey's daughter.

109
00:14:43,886 --> 00:14:47,445
-You need to get to frontier marketplace.
-This will not be a retreat.

110
00:14:47,566 --> 00:14:52,085
-Never Bey, no more escaping.
-You will repulse them.

111
00:14:52,166 --> 00:14:55,165
Then you will draw them to
the forest and end them all.

112
00:14:55,446 --> 00:14:59,005
-As you command, Bey.
-Attack!

113
00:15:01,166 --> 00:15:02,765
-Now!
-Come on!

114
00:15:02,846 --> 00:15:05,605
Yakup Bey, come on!

115
00:15:43,166 --> 00:15:46,925
Alps, fall back to the forest.

116
00:15:48,766 --> 00:15:52,085
Neither them nor us
will get out of this forest..

117
00:15:52,286 --> 00:15:55,525
Until they reach the
marketplace and find an antidote.

118
00:15:55,646 --> 00:15:58,725
Come on, Alps!

119
00:16:13,366 --> 00:16:21,165
Hold on my son, my valiant.
Your father will save you.

120
00:16:21,486 --> 00:16:25,525
My Bey is a martyr now. He is a martyr now.

121
00:16:25,726 --> 00:16:30,165
Don't take him. My Cemal, where are you going?

122
00:16:30,766 --> 00:16:34,965
He is strong like his father, right?

123
00:16:35,686 --> 00:16:39,085
You waited with me for all these years.

124
00:16:39,246 --> 00:16:42,725
Now when you just united with your father..

125
00:16:42,846 --> 00:16:45,965
When you just called him
"father", do not go, alright?

126
00:16:47,406 --> 00:16:52,245
Ulgen, don't do this. Don't lose hope.

127
00:16:57,766 --> 00:17:03,165
-He will be alright, if Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

128
00:17:05,925 --> 00:17:08,685
Bala.

129
00:17:08,846 --> 00:17:14,444
How did you endure this pain?

130
00:17:16,286 --> 00:17:20,165
It is a test.

131
00:17:22,406 --> 00:17:28,285
HE gives life and HE takes it. What can I say.

132
00:17:32,606 --> 00:17:36,285
This world is temporary.

133
00:17:36,406 --> 00:17:41,165
I keep my longing secret in my family.

134
00:17:50,686 --> 00:17:54,445
Come on.

135
00:18:16,286 --> 00:18:19,845
Attack! They have poison in their blood!

136
00:18:19,926 --> 00:18:22,245
Now the ground will have them!

137
00:18:22,366 --> 00:18:24,365
They will not get out of this forest!

138
00:18:24,366 --> 00:18:27,205
We will see who won't get out of this forest.

139
00:18:27,366 --> 00:18:30,085
Come on.

140
00:18:48,126 --> 00:18:51,405
These lands have been graves for many tyrants.

141
00:18:51,486 --> 00:18:53,445
Now it is your time you corrupt dog!

142
00:18:53,566 --> 00:19:00,405
Cheer up the dark spirits! Attack!

143
00:20:24,486 --> 00:20:30,565
Do you think I would go after
them without protecting my back?

144
00:20:31,006 --> 00:20:33,765
You will all die.

145
00:20:33,846 --> 00:20:36,685
Konur Bey, these dogs has trapped us.

146
00:20:37,086 --> 00:20:39,725
-We won't hold.
-Alps.

147
00:20:39,806 --> 00:20:43,645
Fall back to the forest. Cover my back.

148
00:20:49,846 --> 00:20:54,805
Soldiers, attack!

149
00:20:55,646 --> 00:20:57,805
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

150
00:21:18,926 --> 00:21:21,405
-Osman.
-My Bala.

151
00:21:21,486 --> 00:21:26,325
Yakup Bey, where were you!

152
00:21:26,406 --> 00:21:29,205
Yakup Bey, my Gonca is
going, my daughter is fading.

153
00:21:29,366 --> 00:21:32,045
-Where is my Gonca?
-Inside.

154
00:21:33,406 --> 00:21:34,785
-Did Alaeddin find a cure?

155
00:21:34,797 --> 00:21:36,445
They are still looking for it.

156
00:21:36,446 --> 00:21:40,685
Cerkutay remembered something. They
went to look for some weed on the hills.

157
00:21:40,686 --> 00:21:44,085
-We do not have much time, I am afraid.
-My son will find it.

158
00:21:44,286 --> 00:21:48,085
-He will find it.
-I hope so.

159
00:21:48,366 --> 00:21:54,245
Mother Bala. My father.

160
00:22:00,846 --> 00:22:03,965
Osman. Did you also..

161
00:22:04,206 --> 00:22:07,045
No, I am alright.

162
00:22:07,246 --> 00:22:09,325
I am alright.

163
00:22:09,846 --> 00:22:14,525
He got shot by a poison
arrow, it is effecting quickly.

164
00:22:17,446 --> 00:22:22,005
It is bruised. My Allah, protect him.

165
00:22:22,086 --> 00:22:25,045
-Osman.
-My Bala, I am alright.

166
00:22:25,286 --> 00:22:28,645
Do not worry.

167
00:22:28,846 --> 00:22:31,805
My Orhan, you go to the tent.

168
00:22:31,966 --> 00:22:35,045
I will prepare a balm, until Alaeddin comes.

169
00:22:35,126 --> 00:22:38,485
-It will slow the poison.
-Do not worry.

170
00:22:38,846 --> 00:22:41,765
-Do not worry.
-Come on.

171
00:22:56,246 --> 00:23:00,845
My son... Don't say anything to anyone for now.

172
00:23:01,606 --> 00:23:05,365
Father... Don't... You are tiring yourself.

173
00:23:05,526 --> 00:23:10,125
Don't worry, my son. I am alright.

174
00:23:10,966 --> 00:23:14,405
I am alright. Come on.

175
00:23:14,806 --> 00:23:19,685
I'll resist until the ointment is
brought here. Come on, walk.

176
00:23:37,326 --> 00:23:42,085
They took the bait! Osman
Bey's way is now open!

177
00:23:42,446 --> 00:23:46,045
Come on Alps!

178
00:23:48,326 --> 00:23:49,885
Come on Alps!

179
00:24:21,886 --> 00:24:26,045
They will soon see the strength of my soul.

180
00:24:26,206 --> 00:24:34,125
I will crush this soil in such a way that
every plant that grows will be crooked.

181
00:24:43,966 --> 00:24:50,205
The situation is not good, my Bey. Most
of those who were injured became martyrs.

182
00:24:58,046 --> 00:25:00,925
Osman! -No...

183
00:25:01,046 --> 00:25:05,805
-Osman, are you alright?
-They will all pay for it.

184
00:25:07,886 --> 00:25:11,125
My father was injured.
-He was injured?

185
00:25:11,246 --> 00:25:17,405
Osman! Make him sit down!
Osman! My Osman!

186
00:25:18,206 --> 00:25:23,965
-My Allah, protect him!
-Alaeddin, my son...

187
00:25:25,606 --> 00:25:30,085
Osman! My Allah, protect him!

188
00:25:31,646 --> 00:25:35,245
Father! -Welcome, father!

189
00:25:35,486 --> 00:25:39,285
Father! Father, are you alright?

190
00:25:41,366 --> 00:25:46,405
My daughter...

191
00:25:49,966 --> 00:25:53,005
Father.. -Fatma, don't worry.

192
00:25:53,126 --> 00:25:57,205
Come on! Come on, carry him!
-Come on!

193
00:25:57,366 --> 00:25:59,845
-O Allah!
-Let's lay him down!

194
00:25:59,926 --> 00:26:02,645
Slowly! My Osman!

195
00:26:03,486 --> 00:26:06,245
Osman!

196
00:26:08,966 --> 00:26:13,325
Come on! -Here... Slowly.

197
00:26:17,806 --> 00:26:21,045
My angel.. My daughter...

198
00:26:22,086 --> 00:26:26,165
Open your eyes, my beautiful Gonca...

199
00:26:27,526 --> 00:26:31,125
What if she does not wake up, Yakup Bey?

200
00:26:31,366 --> 00:26:35,485
I will not surrender my
daughter to this little wound.

201
00:26:35,566 --> 00:26:40,645
My daughter is strong. She will be alright.

202
00:26:41,886 --> 00:26:46,205
I will bring healers from all around.

203
00:26:46,326 --> 00:26:48,885
No...

204
00:26:49,646 --> 00:26:53,965
Alaeddin Bey talked to all of them.

205
00:26:54,206 --> 00:27:00,965
No one has witnessed this poison before.

206
00:27:01,206 --> 00:27:04,645
I will punish them.

207
00:27:04,926 --> 00:27:10,645
I will rip the hearts of
those who hurt my daughter.

208
00:27:11,566 --> 00:27:14,725
My Gonca..

209
00:27:18,646 --> 00:27:24,645
Ya Shafi... Ya Shafi...
Ya Shafi...

210
00:27:26,166 --> 00:27:29,965
Ya Shafi...

211
00:27:33,046 --> 00:27:37,205
The poison is spreading.

212
00:27:40,726 --> 00:27:47,285
My Allah, let him stay
with us. Please, protect him.

213
00:27:53,846 --> 00:27:58,525
Ya Shafi...
BismillahirRahmaniRahim.

214
00:28:03,646 --> 00:28:07,005
Father, open your eyes...

215
00:28:07,846 --> 00:28:11,965
Mother.. Mother, say something.

216
00:28:12,046 --> 00:28:16,045
My daughter.. Look at me.
Nothing will happen to your father.

217
00:28:16,126 --> 00:28:19,965
Your father is a strong
man. Pull yourself together.

218
00:28:20,646 --> 00:28:24,245
Nothing will happen to him.

219
00:28:28,286 --> 00:28:34,605
Come on brother... Where have you been?

220
00:28:38,046 --> 00:28:41,325
He is having a temperature.

221
00:28:42,086 --> 00:28:48,125
Kismet. Let's prepare
ice and water with vinegar.

222
00:28:56,526 --> 00:29:00,405
Ya Shafi... Ya Shafi...

223
00:29:16,326 --> 00:29:20,165
Ulgen! Ulgen! Ulgen!

224
00:29:20,406 --> 00:29:24,605
We found the herb I remembered.
Alaeddin Bey also knew it.

225
00:29:24,686 --> 00:29:27,485
Our son will survive.

226
00:29:29,646 --> 00:29:31,885
Will it take long, Alaeddin Bey?
-No.

227
00:29:32,006 --> 00:29:36,165
We will take it when it boils.
BismillahirRahmaniRahim.

228
00:29:46,686 --> 00:29:49,125
Alaeddin... My son did you find it?

229
00:29:49,246 --> 00:29:52,845
We did, mother. We did, thanks to Allah.

230
00:29:53,366 --> 00:29:56,725
Cerkutay Bey...

231
00:29:58,686 --> 00:30:04,125
Mother... Mother, what happened to you?

232
00:30:05,246 --> 00:30:08,005
Did... Did Gonca Hatun...

233
00:30:08,166 --> 00:30:12,125
My sister? Bala Hatun?
-It's not Gonca.

234
00:30:12,246 --> 00:30:16,085
Gonca is still unconscious, but...

235
00:30:16,886 --> 00:30:21,565
Your father... Osman Bey was also poisoned.

236
00:30:23,846 --> 00:30:27,405
My father?

237
00:30:30,406 --> 00:30:33,805
My Bey...

238
00:30:41,566 --> 00:30:44,845
You go. Tell us what to do.

239
00:30:45,486 --> 00:30:48,885
Kismet Hatun. Crush the
other plants and boil them.

240
00:30:48,886 --> 00:30:52,325
Make everyone drink it when
it is warm after distilling it.

241
00:30:52,326 --> 00:30:56,245
Yes my Shahzade. -Come on!

242
00:30:58,126 --> 00:31:02,885
Come on!

243
00:31:13,246 --> 00:31:18,925
People! The shifa was found!

244
00:31:19,806 --> 00:31:23,405
We found it, Boran Bey. We found the shifa.

245
00:31:28,126 --> 00:31:31,485
My Allah... Let him stay with us...

246
00:31:31,646 --> 00:31:37,685
My father is strong. He will
get better with Allah's consent.

247
00:31:41,446 --> 00:31:46,365
He will get better.
He will get better.

248
00:31:47,326 --> 00:31:48,925
Father! -Alaeddin...

249
00:31:49,086 --> 00:31:51,085
-Brother.
-Brother.

250
00:31:51,166 --> 00:31:53,365
Did you find the cure?
-I did, brother.

251
00:31:53,486 --> 00:31:56,685
-Thanks to my Allah!
-My brother, you arrived...

252
00:31:56,846 --> 00:31:58,688
...you will heal
my father, right?

253
00:31:58,700 --> 00:32:00,605
He will survive,
my sister. He will.

254
00:32:00,726 --> 00:32:04,205
My Alaeddin, come on.

255
00:32:04,766 --> 00:32:10,205
Father... You will get better.

256
00:32:10,686 --> 00:32:15,285
You will get better if Allah permits.
You will get better.

257
00:32:16,966 --> 00:32:19,565
Alaeddin Bey. It is now warm.

258
00:32:19,646 --> 00:32:23,085
Come on. -Brother..

259
00:32:23,406 --> 00:32:27,205
Make him stand.

260
00:32:30,246 --> 00:32:33,365
BismillahirRahmaniRahim.

261
00:32:33,766 --> 00:32:38,885
Ya Shafi... Ya Shafi..
Ya Shafi...

262
00:32:40,406 --> 00:32:43,125
May it heal him if Allah permits...

263
00:32:43,406 --> 00:32:48,325
-If Allah permits...
-Slowly... slowly...

264
00:32:57,166 --> 00:33:00,005
My son... It will work, right?

265
00:33:00,126 --> 00:33:05,005
-He will get better if Allah permits.
-He will.

266
00:33:06,886 --> 00:33:10,685
You will get better with Allah's
consent. Wake up, my Bey..

267
00:33:12,566 --> 00:33:16,045
I am here, sister! I arrived.

268
00:33:16,366 --> 00:33:20,165
-My lion son..
-Thanks to Allah...

269
00:33:23,006 --> 00:33:26,645
-My Gonca...
-BismillahirRahmaniRahim.

270
00:33:27,286 --> 00:33:30,405
Ya Shafi... Ya Shafi...

271
00:33:30,646 --> 00:33:34,325
Drink it, my daughter...
-Ya Shafi...

272
00:33:48,486 --> 00:33:53,125
Cerkutay... Hold his head.

273
00:34:07,166 --> 00:34:12,324
Come on, my son...
Come on, my valiant...

274
00:34:16,686 --> 00:34:20,725
BismillahirRahmaniRahim
Ya Shafi...

275
00:34:26,246 --> 00:34:30,005
-You will get better.
-Thank you...

276
00:34:32,525 --> 00:34:38,485
Nokers must be after us now.

277
00:34:41,846 --> 00:34:47,645
-Konur Bey, they are coming.
-Aykurt, come on.

278
00:35:06,046 --> 00:35:10,805
They're here, be careful.

279
00:35:39,606 --> 00:35:42,685
The jackal who enters the
wolf's den will end up dying.

280
00:35:42,726 --> 00:35:44,885
You'll be the ones to die!

281
00:36:29,126 --> 00:36:34,085
Your rule in these lands
is over. You'll die soon.

282
00:36:38,446 --> 00:36:42,645
You can never rule in these lands.

283
00:36:45,246 --> 00:36:49,365
Tell me, where is your leader?

284
00:36:54,766 --> 00:36:58,765
Konur Bey. Konur Bey.

285
00:36:59,126 --> 00:37:02,125
This pain will not end if you don't talk.

286
00:37:02,406 --> 00:37:06,645
You cannot hurt Karacelasun.

287
00:37:24,686 --> 00:37:27,445
I have eyes on everywhere.

288
00:37:30,006 --> 00:37:33,485
Speak.

289
00:37:33,766 --> 00:37:35,965
I said speak.

290
00:37:36,206 --> 00:37:44,805
He will be in the inn in the east. He'll
kill you even if you attack him. Go and die.

291
00:37:53,526 --> 00:37:59,525
The one who sees himself over
everyone goes blind. We will kill him too.

292
00:38:01,166 --> 00:38:07,645
Alps, go to the horses. We'll
go to Osman Bey quickly.

293
00:38:13,846 --> 00:38:18,205
Come on sister, open your eyes.

294
00:38:19,046 --> 00:38:22,245
-Mother.
-Gonca.

295
00:38:22,326 --> 00:38:25,805
-My sister is waking up mother.
-Gonca.

296
00:38:26,446 --> 00:38:30,605
Gonca, thankfully. My Gonca.

297
00:38:30,686 --> 00:38:34,205
-Mother.
-Gonca.

298
00:38:34,286 --> 00:38:39,085
-Sister.
-Thankfully.

299
00:38:39,366 --> 00:38:41,845
Father.

300
00:38:41,966 --> 00:38:46,005
Thankfully.

301
00:38:46,326 --> 00:38:49,645
-Thankfully. My daughter...
-Gonca.

302
00:38:49,766 --> 00:38:54,765
Thankfully. My beautiful daughter.

303
00:39:02,726 --> 00:39:08,605
-May I come in?
-Come on in.

304
00:39:10,606 --> 00:39:14,285
Gonca Hatun is finally awake.

305
00:39:14,566 --> 00:39:19,805
-Thank you my Allah.
-Thankfully.

306
00:39:24,006 --> 00:39:28,325
-Thankfully.
-Thanks to Rabb.

307
00:39:30,646 --> 00:39:36,765
If Allah permits my Bey will also wake up.

308
00:39:37,246 --> 00:39:40,165
Osman?

309
00:39:40,446 --> 00:39:43,245
-Osman.
-My Bey.

310
00:39:43,366 --> 00:39:45,965
My Bey!

311
00:39:46,966 --> 00:39:50,005
My Allah, thank you! Thank you my Allah.

312
00:39:50,086 --> 00:39:52,605
Osman?

313
00:39:53,446 --> 00:39:56,645
Thankfully.

314
00:40:01,486 --> 00:40:05,245
He's awake.

315
00:40:05,326 --> 00:40:10,485
Did you think you can get rid of me so easily?

316
00:40:12,206 --> 00:40:15,485
Thankfully.

317
00:40:24,926 --> 00:40:27,685
My Bey? Are you all right?

318
00:40:27,926 --> 00:40:31,285
-I'm all right.
-Do you have any pain?

319
00:40:32,246 --> 00:40:39,165
Of course you'd be all right. Osman
Bey wouldn't fall because of an arrow.

320
00:40:39,686 --> 00:40:42,285
Thankfully.

321
00:40:53,046 --> 00:40:57,605
One risked his life

322
00:40:58,366 --> 00:41:02,765
and the other one the other one...

323
00:41:02,846 --> 00:41:05,645
...did his best to find a cure.

324
00:41:05,926 --> 00:41:11,085
Thank you all.

325
00:41:17,686 --> 00:41:22,285
And the other one keeps praying.

326
00:41:22,486 --> 00:41:27,685
Shush. Don't cry anymore.

327
00:41:27,766 --> 00:41:33,685
-I'm all right. I'm all right.
-Thankfully.

328
00:41:44,286 --> 00:41:47,245
Come on boy.

329
00:41:48,446 --> 00:41:49,885
Mother.

330
00:41:52,726 --> 00:41:53,925
Son?

331
00:41:55,406 --> 00:42:00,605
My brave boy! My boy.

332
00:42:02,206 --> 00:42:05,445
My Allah, thank you!

333
00:42:06,486 --> 00:42:10,045
I couldn't sleep well because of you.

334
00:42:12,126 --> 00:42:16,125
Cerkutay Bey, are you crying?

335
00:42:16,406 --> 00:42:20,685
A man does not cry.

336
00:42:26,966 --> 00:42:31,165
I don't know whether a man cries or not

337
00:42:31,286 --> 00:42:34,405
but fathers cry, son.

338
00:42:34,846 --> 00:42:38,125
-Mother.
-Yes, son?

339
00:42:38,486 --> 00:42:43,765
-Am I Ghazi (veteran) now?
-Ghazi?

340
00:42:47,446 --> 00:42:51,125
Yes, you are Ghazi.

341
00:42:51,446 --> 00:42:52,485
Ulgen.

342
00:42:54,566 --> 00:42:58,925
You know, you would say that I will name him.

343
00:43:01,606 --> 00:43:05,845
Your name is Ghazi from now on.

344
00:43:06,646 --> 00:43:11,405
-Is my name Ghazi from now on?
-Ghazi Alp.

345
00:43:11,566 --> 00:43:15,485
Kiss your mother's hand.

346
00:43:25,406 --> 00:43:30,965
-I'm Ghazi now.
-You are Ghazi.

347
00:43:32,206 --> 00:43:36,885
Cerkutay Bey, Sultan Yakup is waiting for you.

348
00:43:46,806 --> 00:43:52,085
Now, get some rest son.

349
00:44:00,046 --> 00:44:02,845
What's going on?

350
00:44:08,006 --> 00:44:10,645
-Mother.
-Honey.

351
00:44:10,726 --> 00:44:15,245
-I'm Ghazi, right, mother?
-Yes, dear.

352
00:44:23,766 --> 00:44:26,805
Give me patience my Allah!

353
00:44:27,406 --> 00:44:29,845
My Bey is struggling with plenty of things.

354
00:44:30,126 --> 00:44:32,961
Mongolian pagans on
one side, crusading infidels

355
00:44:32,973 --> 00:44:35,365
on the other, and
poison on top of that...

356
00:44:35,606 --> 00:44:39,405
Tawba Astagfirullah. We
couldn't even find the traitor.

357
00:44:39,406 --> 00:44:42,965
Don't worry my Bey, he will
eventually give himself away.

358
00:44:43,086 --> 00:44:47,685
He will, and then we will hunt him down.

359
00:44:47,926 --> 00:44:53,845
-He can't hide forever after all.
-Yes, he can't.

360
00:44:55,926 --> 00:45:01,245
Brother, I've been meaning
to ask you for a while.

361
00:45:01,486 --> 00:45:04,165
I forgot in my haste, I'm sorry.

362
00:45:04,526 --> 00:45:08,565
Your father was sick, right? How did it happen?

363
00:45:08,846 --> 00:45:12,645
My father is all right.

364
00:45:12,846 --> 00:45:16,965
He is all right, Alhamdulillah. Shahzade's
medicine worked well, thankfully.

365
00:45:17,166 --> 00:45:20,165
Praise be, thankfully.

366
00:45:20,366 --> 00:45:24,885
-Thank you.
-Veysel.

367
00:45:26,446 --> 00:45:30,925
How are your parents?

368
00:45:31,446 --> 00:45:36,365
My father was martyred during
the conquest of Inegol, my Bey.

369
00:45:36,446 --> 00:45:39,645
-May Allah rest his soul.
-May Allah bless you.

370
00:45:39,886 --> 00:45:43,565
I have an old mother, praying for your health.

371
00:45:43,686 --> 00:45:46,325
MashaAllah. May Allah give her a long life.

372
00:45:46,446 --> 00:45:49,685
-Aameen.
-Is she in Yenisehir?

373
00:45:49,766 --> 00:45:53,405
No, my Bey. She's in the
countryside, in Tepekoy.

374
00:45:53,486 --> 00:45:59,365
Tepekoy. Right, I know it.

375
00:46:00,686 --> 00:46:04,405
Visit her every once in a
while, don't leave her alone.

376
00:46:04,606 --> 00:46:07,725
Don't neglect her because of your duty.

377
00:46:07,966 --> 00:46:11,765
Okay my Bey. I'll do as you order.

378
00:46:14,126 --> 00:46:17,765
Good news. Bayindir Bey,
the cure has been found.

379
00:46:17,926 --> 00:46:21,725
-Thank you my Rabb!
-Alhamdulillah.

380
00:46:21,966 --> 00:46:26,685
Thankfully! Thankfully.

381
00:46:28,046 --> 00:46:30,463
-My Bey, let me continue
with the inspection.

382
00:46:30,475 --> 00:46:31,285
Right.

383
00:46:31,526 --> 00:46:35,285
-Continue.
-Thank you.

384
00:46:42,806 --> 00:46:46,885
Let's go to the house he talked about tomorrow.

385
00:46:46,966 --> 00:46:51,045
Let's see if he's telling the truth or not.

386
00:46:51,246 --> 00:46:54,085
Do you suspect Veysel?

387
00:46:55,406 --> 00:46:58,365
I would even suspect myself

388
00:46:58,966 --> 00:47:05,125
if I didn't know what I was doing.

389
00:47:06,326 --> 00:47:09,805
Your son is well, right, Cerkutay?

390
00:47:12,206 --> 00:47:15,125
He's good, my Sultan.

391
00:47:15,526 --> 00:47:17,925
-Thanks to Allah.
-Praise be!

392
00:47:18,206 --> 00:47:22,005
Praise be.
Praise be.

393
00:47:25,366 --> 00:47:29,005
Who shot your son Cerkutay?

394
00:47:31,966 --> 00:47:36,405
Mongolians shot him, my Sultan.

395
00:47:42,886 --> 00:47:48,005
Who made Mongolians mess with us?

396
00:47:54,526 --> 00:47:57,965
Osman Bey, my Sultan.

397
00:47:58,006 --> 00:48:01,805
Good. Good.

398
00:48:05,846 --> 00:48:08,645
You see the truth.

399
00:48:08,726 --> 00:48:15,085
-And you'll do your duty properly.
-Always.

400
00:48:15,526 --> 00:48:19,245
My Sultan, as you order.

401
00:48:22,006 --> 00:48:27,245
Now go back to Osman Bey.

402
00:48:29,846 --> 00:48:36,165
But your loyalty will be just for me.

403
00:48:36,726 --> 00:48:40,205
You will stand beside him...

404
00:48:40,726 --> 00:48:44,685
...so we won't get in such troubles again.

405
00:48:45,526 --> 00:48:49,285
And our children won't be hurt.

406
00:48:51,086 --> 00:48:54,205
I was going to lose my child too, Cerkutay.

407
00:48:54,326 --> 00:48:57,645
We were going to have the same suffering.

408
00:48:57,886 --> 00:49:02,605
-We will prevent this.
-My Sultan.

409
00:49:03,566 --> 00:49:06,525
You can ask me to do everything, but...

410
00:49:07,166 --> 00:49:12,325
-Osman Bey...
-Don't, Cerkutay. Don't.

411
00:49:13,366 --> 00:49:17,925
Don't you try to question my orders.

412
00:49:18,446 --> 00:49:22,365
Don't you ever disobey me.

413
00:49:29,966 --> 00:49:34,685
Never forget...

414
00:49:35,446 --> 00:49:39,165
...who saved you...

415
00:49:39,886 --> 00:49:42,685
...and who gave you freedom.

416
00:49:45,246 --> 00:49:48,845
You will be with Osman.

417
00:49:49,726 --> 00:49:54,365
You will be his best man like the old days.

418
00:49:54,926 --> 00:49:59,805
And you will let me know
about every move of his.

419
00:50:02,486 --> 00:50:05,565
As you order, my Sultan.

420
00:50:34,886 --> 00:50:38,045
We'll stop them before they reach Tepekoy.

421
00:50:38,486 --> 00:50:41,525
Otherwise, I'll have to let them meet Vasillis.

422
00:50:49,286 --> 00:50:52,285
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

423
00:50:56,846 --> 00:51:00,445
They hurt us a lot, Osman Bey.

424
00:51:01,006 --> 00:51:04,525
They couldn't even shave our beard.

425
00:51:05,926 --> 00:51:10,885
Don't be worrying. We'll take their hearts out.

426
00:51:13,766 --> 00:51:16,605
You encouraged the beys.

427
00:51:16,966 --> 00:51:20,205
But this is just a dream.

428
00:51:22,926 --> 00:51:27,085
-How can we stand against Olcaytu Khan?
-Yakup Bey.

429
00:51:27,526 --> 00:51:31,805
I tell my alps about 40 warriors of Gokturk.

430
00:51:32,926 --> 00:51:38,165
You say you are a sultan...
Don't make me talk about it.

431
00:51:39,366 --> 00:51:45,045
You hear the epic Turks made
with blood not just a dream from me.

432
00:51:47,086 --> 00:51:50,965
What happened to those warriors?

433
00:51:52,566 --> 00:51:55,605
Who did they get killed?

434
00:51:56,366 --> 00:51:58,725
Because they had a khan...

435
00:51:58,766 --> 00:52:04,605
...who was having dreams beyond his power.

436
00:52:07,246 --> 00:52:11,325
You're right, Yakup Bey.

437
00:52:11,886 --> 00:52:18,125
Those who don't dream neither die
nor achieve. We have decided to achieve.

438
00:52:21,846 --> 00:52:25,325
We will prevail with Allah's will.

439
00:52:26,966 --> 00:52:32,605
Open the map, Mehmed. Let's see the situation.

440
00:52:33,606 --> 00:52:39,765
Let's see what epics
Osman Bey will have for us.

441
00:52:50,646 --> 00:52:55,325
We wore them out. We captured their castles.

442
00:52:56,246 --> 00:53:00,685
Lords are afraid of us, but...

443
00:53:02,006 --> 00:53:05,085
...Byzantine is still there.

444
00:53:07,406 --> 00:53:11,005
Don't forget the Crusades, Osman.

445
00:53:11,406 --> 00:53:15,325
Don't cross the line.

446
00:53:16,646 --> 00:53:19,725
We can't fight in two fronts.

447
00:53:20,326 --> 00:53:25,485
If Pope makes a call for help

448
00:53:26,406 --> 00:53:31,045
...we will be stuck between
two armies and be destroyed.

449
00:53:34,126 --> 00:53:36,645
You're right.

450
00:53:36,806 --> 00:53:41,965
Because the army of Olcaytu
Khan we want to rise against...

451
00:53:42,606 --> 00:53:45,485
...is twice as big as Byzantine.

452
00:53:46,806 --> 00:53:51,245
We are actually having a
dream for the impossible.

453
00:53:53,686 --> 00:53:57,285
But those without courage
will never understand us.

454
00:53:58,086 --> 00:54:03,405
For sure, we have courage.

455
00:54:08,366 --> 00:54:14,485
Yakup Bey, with or without you...

456
00:54:17,166 --> 00:54:21,045
...we will establish the free state.

457
00:54:27,246 --> 00:54:31,325
I'm happy that we've survived a great disaster.

458
00:54:31,726 --> 00:54:36,805
Thanks, beauty. We are all happy.

459
00:54:38,806 --> 00:54:44,165
Thanks, Holofira. But you seem so upset.

460
00:54:44,646 --> 00:54:49,725
I'm good. My horses died during the raid.

461
00:54:51,526 --> 00:54:56,645
Sorry about that, Holofira.
I know it's not easy.

462
00:55:00,726 --> 00:55:05,525
Gonca Hatun, have you become a ghazi too?

463
00:55:05,886 --> 00:55:10,285
Yes. I've become a ghazi too, Cerkutay Alp.

464
00:55:10,286 --> 00:55:13,485
Well, my name is Ghazi now.

465
00:55:13,566 --> 00:55:17,885
-Ghazi? Ulgen?
-Yes.

466
00:55:18,086 --> 00:55:21,645
His name is Ghazi now. His father...

467
00:55:22,086 --> 00:55:26,685
You have a real name now,
huh, Ghazi Alp? May it be blessed.

468
00:55:28,566 --> 00:55:31,365
My dear.

469
00:55:32,126 --> 00:55:35,805
I'm a ghazi now. Will you
marry me, Gonca Hatun?

470
00:55:35,806 --> 00:55:38,765
Shut up! Shame on you!

471
00:55:42,806 --> 00:55:46,165
You need to ask for the girl
from her mother first, Ghazi Alp.

472
00:55:46,366 --> 00:55:49,645
You need to see what her parents think.

473
00:55:50,446 --> 00:55:52,565
Saadet Hatun!

474
00:55:54,286 --> 00:55:58,325
Will you give me Gonca to marry?
Let me kiss your hand if you do!

475
00:56:01,966 --> 00:56:07,365
I don't know. My daughter may
have someone else in her heart, huh?

476
00:56:10,926 --> 00:56:16,725
-We need to ask Gonca first.
-Get down here.

477
00:56:21,646 --> 00:56:26,885
-Do you?
-Be quiet!

478
00:56:30,966 --> 00:56:35,965
You need to grow up first, Ghazi
Alp. Marriage is not a child's game.

479
00:56:36,286 --> 00:56:40,005
It has a heavy burden. You are too young.

480
00:56:40,326 --> 00:56:43,765
Your shoulders can't carry this heavy burden.

481
00:56:45,166 --> 00:56:49,085
You will find your match, if Allah permits.

482
00:56:55,486 --> 00:56:58,205
Then you stop growing up, Gonca Hatun.

483
00:56:58,246 --> 00:57:00,885
I'll grow older and we can get married!

484
00:57:01,166 --> 00:57:05,925
My Allah! You're speaking
madly! Oh, did you bite me?

485
00:57:09,566 --> 00:57:14,765
I'm sorry. I think the
poison affected his mouth.

486
00:57:27,606 --> 00:57:33,525
-My Bey, do I have permission?
-Come, son.

487
00:57:37,926 --> 00:57:42,325
If the Mongolian army
comes with the siege weapons,

488
00:57:42,766 --> 00:57:46,445
...they will use these routes.

489
00:57:47,406 --> 00:57:50,605
They are easy to hold.

490
00:57:52,086 --> 00:57:56,885
A hundred men can stall
even a thousand for days.

491
00:57:57,606 --> 00:58:00,805
Do I have permission, my Bey?

492
00:58:05,046 --> 00:58:08,285
You are talking good.

493
00:58:08,966 --> 00:58:11,685
But you are talking wrong, Orhan Bey.

494
00:58:14,406 --> 00:58:18,485
If they come for destroying
instead of capturing,

495
00:58:19,326 --> 00:58:24,365
...they will pass over the huge mountain
and come down on us as thousands.

496
00:58:31,046 --> 00:58:34,525
The army will not come.

497
00:58:37,646 --> 00:58:44,645
If it were to come, it would've by now.
Their intention is to make us powerless.

498
00:58:45,086 --> 00:58:51,205
They will hit the caravans, they
will hit the Beys and marketplaces.

499
00:58:51,286 --> 00:58:55,725
They will even hit Sultans.

500
00:58:57,046 --> 00:59:01,965
Their intention is to have
the alps away from the war.

501
00:59:02,686 --> 00:59:08,925
-Then what?
-Then the army will come.

502
00:59:12,606 --> 00:59:17,125
However, it is clear what to do.

503
00:59:17,366 --> 00:59:21,965
Now, we will have a feast in Yenisehir.

504
00:59:23,206 --> 00:59:26,765
We will make a festival.

505
00:59:28,286 --> 00:59:33,245
Osman Bey. We are having a war council.

506
00:59:33,326 --> 00:59:36,845
We're saying that trouble
comes in two different ways.

507
00:59:37,046 --> 00:59:41,245
And you leave the council
saying "We will have a feast".

508
00:59:41,326 --> 00:59:46,325
So, Yakup Bey. Don't you
think they will hear about it?

509
00:59:47,246 --> 00:59:52,645
Won't they say; "We are
hitting them from all sides."

510
00:59:52,726 --> 00:59:57,205
"However, muslims' joy does not falter."

511
00:59:58,206 --> 01:00:04,645
Their intention is to break our
spirits. We will not be broken.

512
01:00:08,286 --> 01:00:13,605
Yakup Bey. You are also invited.

513
01:00:14,046 --> 01:00:17,405
No, keep it.

514
01:00:18,766 --> 01:00:21,165
Alright.

515
01:00:21,446 --> 01:00:22,565
-Boran.
-My Bey.

516
01:00:22,646 --> 01:00:26,765
Send word to all frontier marketplace.

517
01:00:26,846 --> 01:00:31,765
-If anyone wants to come, they are welcomed.
-As my Bey commands.

518
01:00:33,926 --> 01:00:39,685
Yakup Bey. You send word to Beys.

519
01:00:39,766 --> 01:00:43,365
Have them ready the armies.

520
01:00:44,086 --> 01:00:51,165
First, we will stand up at the table.
Then, We will deal them the biggest blow.

521
01:00:58,446 --> 01:01:02,525
Stay safe now.

522
01:01:18,326 --> 01:01:23,325
Mother, open up. We are friends of Veysel.

523
01:01:26,006 --> 01:01:32,365
Bayindir, you are looking for trouble. Don't.

524
01:01:32,846 --> 01:01:36,645
Tell yourself she is missing and walk away.

525
01:01:36,726 --> 01:01:41,725
-What do you command us to do, Bayindir Bey?
-Open it, brother.

526
01:01:42,006 --> 01:01:46,325
Okay.

527
01:01:54,406 --> 01:01:59,565
Those who wander in wrong
places bound to fall in every trap.

528
01:02:33,406 --> 01:02:40,045
That corrupt dog. For how
long was he eating with us.

529
01:02:41,006 --> 01:02:44,605
We noticed it late. Very late.

530
01:02:45,726 --> 01:02:50,405
-We're starting.
-Alright, move.

531
01:02:55,446 --> 01:03:03,445
Who were you looking for?
There is only death for you here.

532
01:03:07,926 --> 01:03:15,445
I know very well about
what you call "treachery".

533
01:03:16,166 --> 01:03:22,565
Precaution is our faithful friend. Alps!

534
01:03:30,086 --> 01:03:35,205
In this deal, everyone can
get everything they want.

535
01:03:35,366 --> 01:03:41,205
Since you want death you are welcomed.

536
01:03:41,286 --> 01:03:45,645
-Come on!
-O Allah!

537
01:04:03,846 --> 01:04:06,365
Damn it.

538
01:04:12,726 --> 01:04:17,085
They know me now.

539
01:04:17,406 --> 01:04:22,365
The palace duty is over for me.

540
01:04:25,606 --> 01:04:29,965
-Saadet Hatun.
-Bala Hatun.

541
01:04:30,366 --> 01:04:33,445
Osman Bey is inviting
everyone to the feast at evening.

542
01:04:33,726 --> 01:04:36,845
-We would like to see you among us.
-Thank you, Bala Hatun.

543
01:04:37,006 --> 01:04:42,205
I will talk with Yakup Bey, and let you know.

544
01:04:47,446 --> 01:04:53,005
Bala Hatun is acting very
close to us, right Gonca?

545
01:04:55,526 --> 01:05:00,765
Gonca, come here.

546
01:05:07,606 --> 01:05:09,969
-Did you bury my horse?

547
01:05:09,981 --> 01:05:13,445
They buried it
with other horses.

548
01:05:17,686 --> 01:05:21,645
Don't be sad my lady. You will be sick.

549
01:05:21,726 --> 01:05:27,765
Do not worry, I am alright.
You can get back to your duty.

550
01:05:34,286 --> 01:05:37,845
Holofira.

551
01:05:39,926 --> 01:05:44,885
Hope you are alright.
Sorry, we could not take care of you.

552
01:05:45,086 --> 01:05:49,285
As you know the situation, my sister.

553
01:05:49,446 --> 01:05:53,325
I am alright, thank you. As you can see.

554
01:05:53,566 --> 01:05:58,605
I can see alright. You
are like a drop of water.

555
01:06:00,126 --> 01:06:05,205
-Gonca, how is she?
-Thank Allah, she is alright.

556
01:06:05,366 --> 01:06:10,605
However, now I think about
you. Those dogs killed your horse.

557
01:06:11,086 --> 01:06:17,005
You can not hide your
pain. I know how hard it is.

558
01:06:18,006 --> 01:06:22,765
I also put my horse Akkiremit way back.

559
01:06:27,166 --> 01:06:30,845
My pain is fresh. However, it will pass.

560
01:06:30,966 --> 01:06:35,485
I will get used to it for sure, thank you.

561
01:06:41,246 --> 01:06:44,925
Your tears hurt my heart.

562
01:06:45,726 --> 01:06:49,285
Do not be sad, Holofira.

563
01:06:59,166 --> 01:07:03,645
I know it won't replace your horse, however..

564
01:07:03,766 --> 01:07:07,125
I would like to gift you a horse.

565
01:07:10,006 --> 01:07:16,485
That is very thoughtful of
you. But I have to decline.

566
01:07:18,006 --> 01:07:24,725
If I would need a horse I can
buy it myself, I do not need you.

567
01:07:24,966 --> 01:07:30,045
Thank you.

568
01:07:37,566 --> 01:07:43,605
When I take Holofira from your
hands, you will be very hurt, Orhan.

569
01:07:47,206 --> 01:07:50,685
My Gonca. Get prepared.

570
01:07:50,886 --> 01:07:54,605
You will go to Osman Bey's invitation as well.

571
01:07:54,686 --> 01:07:58,285
Mother, didn't father told us to not go?

572
01:07:58,406 --> 01:08:03,605
We won't go, you will.

573
01:08:04,006 --> 01:08:07,085
-Mother, what will I do there alone?
-My Gonca.

574
01:08:07,606 --> 01:08:11,485
You will be our eyes and ears in that palace.

575
01:08:11,686 --> 01:08:17,484
Stay alert. Osman will not just sit around.

576
01:08:18,406 --> 01:08:24,805
-As you command, mother.
-You'll know what to do.

577
01:08:37,966 --> 01:08:42,285
My Allah.

578
01:08:50,805 --> 01:08:55,564
Where did I put that handkerchief?

579
01:09:02,366 --> 01:09:06,444
Holofira.

580
01:09:14,166 --> 01:09:20,365
That's why I don't want you to come
to marketplace, Mehmed is on your tail.

581
01:09:21,765 --> 01:09:27,045
Still, you told him alright.

582
01:09:28,366 --> 01:09:32,765
Right? And what did you do, Orhan?

583
01:09:33,126 --> 01:09:38,965
While your mother announces
the bride she has chosen for you?

584
01:09:43,725 --> 01:09:49,645
What was her name.. Aysima.

585
01:09:50,886 --> 01:09:57,325
While she can not tell them
enough, what did you do, Orhan?

586
01:09:58,166 --> 01:10:01,885
Holofira.

587
01:10:24,006 --> 01:10:29,765
Since I declared my love to you..

588
01:10:30,086 --> 01:10:35,125
I don't care what my mother says or wants.

589
01:10:35,286 --> 01:10:39,805
For me, there is only you, lord's daughter.

590
01:10:46,326 --> 01:10:51,165
-May it be easy.
-Sister.

591
01:10:52,046 --> 01:10:59,805
Holofira, we're doing a feast in palace
at evening, my father expects you.

592
01:11:01,086 --> 01:11:05,205
As we know what you
did for my brother at Kestel.

593
01:11:05,486 --> 01:11:10,245
We want to thank you.

594
01:11:11,646 --> 01:11:17,965
You will come, lord's daughter?

595
01:11:27,326 --> 01:11:32,605
Aysima, my daughter. We expect
you at Yenisehir in the evening.

596
01:11:32,846 --> 01:11:34,174
-Yenisehir?

597
01:11:34,186 --> 01:11:38,205
We're having a feast at
the palace, you're welcomed.

598
01:11:38,486 --> 01:11:41,725
As you wish, Malhun Hatun.

599
01:11:44,046 --> 01:11:46,805
Alps are ready, Malhun Hatun.
-All right.

600
01:11:46,966 --> 01:11:50,325
Come on daughter, don't be late.

601
01:12:19,086 --> 01:12:23,245
-May I come in my Bey?
-Come on in.

602
01:12:34,566 --> 01:12:38,405
-My Bey.
-Did you find him, Bayindir?

603
01:12:38,926 --> 01:12:41,725
I did, my Bey.

604
01:12:42,046 --> 01:12:45,205
-But I couldn't bring him before you.
-Who is he?

605
01:12:45,806 --> 01:12:49,725
Dastard Veysel.

606
01:12:51,166 --> 01:12:55,845
Even his name is not Veysel.
He is working for Crusaders.

607
01:12:56,006 --> 01:12:59,765
I went to his house to confirm what he said.

608
01:12:59,846 --> 01:13:03,565
We were ambushed there, that's why he escaped.

609
01:13:03,566 --> 01:13:04,405
We were ambushed there that's why he escaped.

610
01:13:21,206 --> 01:13:25,525
You're all right, that's the important thing.

611
01:13:27,566 --> 01:13:31,565
We've been looking for that traitor for
a long time but no one could find him.

612
01:13:31,646 --> 01:13:36,925
Well done. Well done,
you have shown your skills.

613
01:13:37,126 --> 01:13:40,845
Thank you my Bey. Thank you, but

614
01:13:41,046 --> 01:13:42,325
I couldn't finish it.

615
01:13:42,486 --> 01:13:45,685
You will finish it eventually.

616
01:13:45,846 --> 01:13:49,765
But be careful

617
01:13:49,926 --> 01:13:52,485
do not let Yakup Bey take advantage of it.

618
01:13:52,566 --> 01:13:55,765
If he gets this opportunity

619
01:13:55,846 --> 01:13:59,205
He will definitely use it against us.

620
01:13:59,886 --> 01:14:02,285
Get this done quickly.

621
01:14:02,446 --> 01:14:05,525
-Yes, my Bey.
-May I come in my Bey?

622
01:14:05,646 --> 01:14:08,885
Come in.

623
01:14:17,726 --> 01:14:19,685
My Bey.

624
01:14:20,566 --> 01:14:23,525
I couldn't kill Karacelasun.

625
01:14:23,686 --> 01:14:27,405
-But I know where he is.
-Alright.

626
01:14:31,366 --> 01:14:34,405
Alright, but...

627
01:14:37,006 --> 01:14:41,405
...tell me, you gain victory

628
01:14:41,526 --> 01:14:44,885
but you are hesitant to say it.

629
01:14:45,006 --> 01:14:48,045
Why are you acting like this?

630
01:14:49,606 --> 01:14:52,285
We will raise now.

631
01:14:52,446 --> 01:14:55,165
Don't bow your heads we will stand.

632
01:14:55,286 --> 01:14:59,325
This is how soldiers of Islam should be.

633
01:14:59,966 --> 01:15:02,125
-Boran.
-My Bey.

634
01:15:02,206 --> 01:15:04,405
Alps will be ready in the morning.

635
01:15:04,486 --> 01:15:08,285
Bows, arrows, spears, everything will be ready.

636
01:15:08,406 --> 01:15:11,805
But no need for plenty of
men, pick the best ones.

637
01:15:12,166 --> 01:15:14,725
Yes, my Bey.

638
01:15:15,446 --> 01:15:18,485
And the most daring one

639
01:15:18,726 --> 01:15:21,565
will be leading them.

640
01:15:22,046 --> 01:15:26,245
It tastes great. Take it.

641
01:15:27,126 --> 01:15:31,325
Gonca, daughter, you just
got up, do not tire yourself.

642
01:15:31,486 --> 01:15:36,485
Of course not, Bala Hatun. I can't
slack while everyone else is working.

643
01:15:36,726 --> 01:15:39,605
Praise be. But do not tire yourself out.

644
01:15:39,726 --> 01:15:41,965
All right.

645
01:15:48,766 --> 01:15:51,685
You always keep Gonca with you.

646
01:15:51,846 --> 01:15:55,125
I'm trying to get to know her
to see if she's like her mother

647
01:15:55,406 --> 01:15:58,485
or is she who she seems to be?

648
01:15:58,886 --> 01:16:00,725
Malhun.

649
01:16:00,806 --> 01:16:03,125
But I liked Aysima a lot.

650
01:16:03,406 --> 01:16:06,365
She's well-mannered and beautiful.

651
01:16:06,446 --> 01:16:10,205
She's also strong, we've
seen her skills during the raid.

652
01:16:10,286 --> 01:16:12,885
It will be done when Orhan says yes.

653
01:16:13,046 --> 01:16:16,285
-If Allah permits!
-Come on.

654
01:16:18,246 --> 01:16:22,525
Speak of the devil.

655
01:16:22,886 --> 01:16:26,605
-Welcome, daughter.
-Thank you, Malhun Hatun.

656
01:16:26,606 --> 01:16:29,685
I didn't want to approach as
you were busy this morning.

657
01:16:29,766 --> 01:16:34,285
I hope it gets better soon, and I made halwa.

658
01:16:40,966 --> 01:16:44,965
Thank you, daughter. You did very well.

659
01:16:45,086 --> 01:16:47,765
My Orhan loves halwa.

660
01:16:48,086 --> 01:16:51,245
Sisters, bring plates, come on.

661
01:16:51,446 --> 01:16:53,045
Aysima?

662
01:16:54,286 --> 01:16:59,805
-What are you doing here?
-Thank you, Gonca Hatun.

663
01:16:59,926 --> 01:17:03,725
So you know each other?

664
01:17:04,726 --> 01:17:07,765
Very well. Very well.

665
01:17:07,966 --> 01:17:12,445
We want her to be the bride of
my Orhan if it's meant to be like that.

666
01:17:22,486 --> 01:17:24,485
Orhan?

667
01:17:24,686 --> 01:17:28,325
Whoever I wish for, he comes. Come here.

668
01:17:28,806 --> 01:17:32,205
Where do you think you're going. Come.

669
01:17:32,446 --> 01:17:34,965
Aysima brought us halwa.

670
01:17:35,446 --> 01:17:38,845
I said my Orhan loves it and then you appeared.

671
01:17:38,926 --> 01:17:42,445
-Right?
-Yes, that's right.

672
01:17:43,366 --> 01:17:47,845
Daughter, give Orhan a
plate of halwa, let him taste it.

673
01:17:49,606 --> 01:17:52,165
Mother, how many times
more do I have to tell you?

674
01:17:52,286 --> 01:17:54,485
I do not want it. Why do you trying so hard?

675
01:17:54,486 --> 01:17:57,045
Orhan, I'm not telling you to marry.

676
01:17:57,126 --> 01:18:00,605
But get to know her, don't
you care for your mother at all?

677
01:18:01,046 --> 01:18:03,325
-Why would I get to know her?
-Orhan.

678
01:18:03,406 --> 01:18:06,485
Do not make me repeat myself, come on.

679
01:18:07,126 --> 01:18:08,885
Come on.

680
01:18:18,126 --> 01:18:19,685
Sisters, come on.

681
01:18:19,806 --> 01:18:23,245
Fatma, Gonca, come on daughter.

682
01:18:23,446 --> 01:18:25,765
Come on.

683
01:18:27,046 --> 01:18:31,565
-Enjoy your food, Orhan Bey.
-Thank you, Aysima Hatun, but,

684
01:18:31,726 --> 01:18:35,525
-I'm full.
-It's a dessert, after all.

685
01:18:35,606 --> 01:18:38,365
But if you don't want it..

686
01:18:56,806 --> 01:18:59,765
Do you like it?

687
01:18:59,886 --> 01:19:02,525
Thank you, it tastes well.

688
01:19:02,606 --> 01:19:05,045
Enjoy it.

689
01:19:11,606 --> 01:19:14,165
Thank you, that's enough for me.

690
01:19:14,326 --> 01:19:17,645
It tastes very well, thank you.

691
01:19:32,966 --> 01:19:37,885
They've seen you, ma'am,
you need to stay strong.

692
01:19:38,366 --> 01:19:41,405
If they want to play games,

693
01:19:42,446 --> 01:19:45,245
then I'll play.

694
01:19:48,406 --> 01:19:52,965
-Enjoy it.
-Holofira?

695
01:19:59,886 --> 01:20:02,525
Everyone is here.

696
01:20:02,726 --> 01:20:05,765
We're late, Andra.

697
01:20:09,166 --> 01:20:13,965
-I'm so happy to see you well, Gonca.
-Thank you, Holofira.

698
01:20:14,126 --> 01:20:18,605
Welcome, Holofira, but you shouldn't
have bothered all the way here.

699
01:20:18,686 --> 01:20:22,845
-You're a guest.
-Mother.

700
01:20:28,486 --> 01:20:32,085
Thank you, Malhun Hatun.

701
01:20:32,686 --> 01:20:35,845
We've never met.

702
01:20:38,846 --> 01:20:41,365
I'm Aysima.

703
01:20:42,286 --> 01:20:46,445
Nice to meet you a lot.

704
01:20:46,806 --> 01:20:49,325
Holofira.

705
01:20:55,286 --> 01:21:01,205
If everything is ready,
let's go to the council.

706
01:21:07,686 --> 01:21:10,965
Brother... Here.

707
01:21:11,126 --> 01:21:13,725
Drink.

708
01:21:19,046 --> 01:21:22,525
Apparently, tonight will be
very difficult for you, brother.

709
01:21:22,806 --> 01:21:26,845
Stop there, my sister. Stop.

710
01:21:28,726 --> 01:21:32,266
Ah mother... Ah... You did this to me.

711
01:21:32,266 --> 01:21:35,325
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

712
01:21:35,686 --> 01:21:39,965
Father... I am embarrassed.

713
01:21:41,206 --> 01:21:45,205
But this happened although
we took strict precautions.

714
01:21:45,526 --> 01:21:51,485
Mehmet... You did your duty well, my son.

715
01:21:52,486 --> 01:21:55,885
Besides, we are struggling
with Mongols because of Osman.

716
01:21:56,046 --> 01:21:58,765
How can he be a hero?

717
01:21:59,006 --> 01:22:02,645
First, he must answer for that.

718
01:22:02,846 --> 01:22:08,765
You must see the result, Hatun.
All Beys are asking for a fight.

719
01:22:10,326 --> 01:22:14,205
Many things happen but..

720
01:22:14,286 --> 01:22:18,285
...Osman gains the most every time.

721
01:22:18,526 --> 01:22:22,285
What do you mean, Yakup Bey?

722
01:22:22,886 --> 01:22:27,925
Do you think it is Osman's game?
-We'll see, Hatun.

723
01:22:28,206 --> 01:22:30,685
We'll see.

724
01:22:31,366 --> 01:22:37,205
Cerkutay will now stand next to Osman.

725
01:22:38,366 --> 01:22:44,485
But... he will serve us.

726
01:22:46,446 --> 01:22:50,805
If Osman gets over him and...

727
01:22:50,966 --> 01:22:53,685
...makes another plan...

728
01:22:54,046 --> 01:22:56,805
...there will be bloodshed.

729
01:22:58,166 --> 01:23:01,285
Then...

730
01:23:02,646 --> 01:23:06,165
...it will be a shame for my lands.

731
01:23:06,446 --> 01:23:09,965
Can I come in, my Bey?

732
01:23:10,206 --> 01:23:15,085
Come in, Cerkutay.

733
01:23:26,646 --> 01:23:30,005
My Bey...

734
01:23:31,046 --> 01:23:34,565
I do not want to stay away from you anymore.

735
01:23:42,166 --> 01:23:46,565
If you allow me, I want to gather my family..

736
01:23:46,686 --> 01:23:51,445
...and come back to my lands, my Bey.

737
01:24:06,206 --> 01:24:11,805
There is always a room
for you here, don't worry.

738
01:24:12,246 --> 01:24:16,085
Of course, we will find
a suitable duty for you.

739
01:24:19,206 --> 01:24:22,565
Come on. Have some rest now.

740
01:24:22,726 --> 01:24:25,685
I had... I had
enough rest, my Bey.

741
01:24:25,766 --> 01:24:28,005
I did.

742
01:24:28,086 --> 01:24:32,845
Now allow me to fight.

743
01:24:32,926 --> 01:24:37,045
Praise be to my valiant.

744
01:24:39,726 --> 01:24:44,085
This is my valiant.

745
01:24:56,606 --> 01:24:58,845
Now Osman will die...

746
01:24:59,006 --> 01:25:02,405
I will have taken my brother's revenge...

747
01:25:02,526 --> 01:25:07,365
Even meat tastes better now.

748
01:25:13,846 --> 01:25:18,325
Taste. -I haven't taken my revenge yet.

749
01:25:18,726 --> 01:25:23,925
Before I send those barbarians
away from these heavenly lands...

750
01:25:24,006 --> 01:25:26,445
...I cannot find peace.

751
01:25:30,486 --> 01:25:33,565
Where are your men?

752
01:25:33,646 --> 01:25:37,365
Apparently Osman killed them.

753
01:25:37,766 --> 01:25:41,165
What if they told him your location?

754
01:25:43,286 --> 01:25:48,405
Good then. Osman will come
to me to get himself killed.

755
01:25:52,126 --> 01:25:55,685
Crusader's man came.

756
01:25:55,806 --> 01:25:58,565
Let him in.

757
01:26:11,086 --> 01:26:13,205
Vasilis..

758
01:26:13,366 --> 01:26:18,685
Osman and Yakup's daughter are alive.

759
01:26:33,886 --> 01:26:38,765
It was impossible for them to
survive after being poisoned!

760
01:26:39,046 --> 01:26:43,165
How did that happen?
-Not only that...

761
01:26:45,646 --> 01:26:50,005
I was exposed, Master Gera.

762
01:26:51,566 --> 01:26:54,525
Bayindir noticed me.

763
01:26:55,166 --> 01:26:58,085
Come on now.
BismillahirRahmaniRahim.

764
01:26:58,206 --> 01:27:01,885
Here. -BismillahirRahmaniRahim.

765
01:27:22,166 --> 01:27:25,445
Gonca, my daughter...
You did well by coming here.

766
01:27:25,526 --> 01:27:28,605
Thank you Bala Hatun.

767
01:27:33,406 --> 01:27:35,325
I mean all of you...

768
01:27:35,406 --> 01:27:39,885
You did well by coming here.
Praise be to my beautiful daughters.

769
01:27:43,006 --> 01:27:46,685
Aysima is Kasim Bey's daughter, Osman Bey.

770
01:27:46,966 --> 01:27:50,605
She saved my life during the raid.

771
01:27:50,806 --> 01:27:54,765
Praise be. Praise be.
Thank you, my daughter.

772
01:27:54,846 --> 01:27:59,485
Not at all, Malhun Hatun.
Anyone would do the same.

773
01:28:03,486 --> 01:28:07,605
They are all at their marrying age. Praise be!

774
01:28:07,766 --> 01:28:10,445
But they are single.

775
01:28:12,446 --> 01:28:16,885
Osman Bey will not approve this.

776
01:28:17,486 --> 01:28:22,485
Who am I? That's what our
Rasulullah Efendi (PBUH) said.

777
01:28:24,886 --> 01:28:29,645
When it is time, you should not delay it.

778
01:28:29,886 --> 01:28:35,165
Right... Right Gonca Hatun?

779
01:28:36,446 --> 01:28:39,645
Gonca Hatun will not get married!

780
01:28:39,846 --> 01:28:42,765
She is waiting for me to
grow up! Don't you dare!

781
01:28:43,046 --> 01:28:47,005
Oh is she? -Ghazi...

782
01:28:47,246 --> 01:28:49,605
Shut up... You disgraced us.

783
01:28:49,886 --> 01:28:53,405
Why would I? It's love! I was being honest!

784
01:28:53,486 --> 01:28:56,165
Speak, my lion. We are supporting you!

785
01:28:56,326 --> 01:28:58,765
I said my words, I forgot the rest!

786
01:28:58,886 --> 01:29:01,725
-Now it is enough!
-O praise be!

787
01:29:03,726 --> 01:29:05,845
Ghazi.. Ghazi...

788
01:29:06,046 --> 01:29:09,645
Ghazi... eat your food come on, my lion.

789
01:29:10,926 --> 01:29:18,125
Alaeddin... You couldn't even be as brave
as this little boy, keep watching there.

790
01:29:18,406 --> 01:29:21,925
Ghazi will grow up and ask
Gonca Hatun before you...

791
01:29:22,046 --> 01:29:24,765
...then you'll see.

792
01:29:25,006 --> 01:29:28,285
Do you think it is easy? Besides...

793
01:29:28,366 --> 01:29:32,445
...look at yourself before talking about me.

794
01:29:33,046 --> 01:29:35,525
You are right.

795
01:29:37,886 --> 01:29:41,565
So my Cerkutay.. Tell me.

796
01:29:41,766 --> 01:29:45,125
Are you doing something to heal your hand?

797
01:29:45,406 --> 01:29:49,885
I... am not doing anything, my Bey.

798
01:29:50,526 --> 01:29:56,365
I accepted it. I bowed down.
-Why are you saying that?

799
01:29:57,806 --> 01:30:01,365
Boran! -My Bey.
-Bring those here.

800
01:30:01,446 --> 01:30:03,965
Yes my Bey. -My Bey...

801
01:30:04,126 --> 01:30:08,445
What will he bring? -The entrustment.

802
01:30:29,806 --> 01:30:33,125
After what you said...

803
01:30:34,206 --> 01:30:37,165
...then the things that will heal you...

804
01:30:37,246 --> 01:30:39,765
...are these swords.

805
01:30:39,846 --> 01:30:45,005
-My Bey... I don't want them.
-I did not ask you.

806
01:30:46,086 --> 01:30:48,045
Come on, hold them.

807
01:30:48,486 --> 01:30:50,439
Those were entrusted to you.

808
01:30:50,451 --> 01:30:53,365
Those were entrusted
to you by Bamsi Bey.

809
01:30:54,006 --> 01:30:59,725
We did not dismiss you
from your duty, Cerkutay.

810
01:31:01,446 --> 01:31:04,045
Thank you my Bey.

811
01:31:04,646 --> 01:31:10,605
There is no need to make
Sultan mad. Still, do your duty.

812
01:31:12,206 --> 01:31:17,485
Yes my Bey. -Come on then.

813
01:31:18,006 --> 01:31:20,965
So that we are having a good day...

814
01:31:21,046 --> 01:31:22,325
...Boran. -My Bey.

815
01:31:22,406 --> 01:31:24,445
Play your qopuz.

816
01:31:24,566 --> 01:31:27,085
Yes my Bey.

817
01:31:28,366 --> 01:31:30,525
My Bey...

818
01:31:34,326 --> 01:31:38,365
Come on. You may sit.

819
01:31:51,006 --> 01:31:55,285
Your man is not saying
any good words, Crusader.

820
01:31:55,486 --> 01:31:58,885
Since no one died...

821
01:31:59,926 --> 01:32:02,045
...this attack will gather Turks.

822
01:32:02,126 --> 01:32:04,525
They can all gather and embrace each other...

823
01:32:04,606 --> 01:32:09,325
...I can still kill Osman
and Yakup, all of them!

824
01:32:09,486 --> 01:32:14,525
Then what? Your greed must not blind you.

825
01:32:14,646 --> 01:32:18,405
Their children, commanders, Alps...

826
01:32:18,486 --> 01:32:21,245
They will all unite and attack us.

827
01:32:21,486 --> 01:32:27,205
I will not hesitate attacking them even
if I stand against a thousand people.

828
01:32:27,366 --> 01:32:32,605
I will not stop even if my sword is broken.
-You will, Mongol.

829
01:32:32,726 --> 01:32:36,685
Because they will kill each other.

830
01:32:36,886 --> 01:32:40,485
What is the fox in your
head saying again, Crusader?

831
01:32:40,566 --> 01:32:45,605
So that our brother Vasilis was exposed...

832
01:32:46,646 --> 01:32:50,285
...I will use him in such a way that...

833
01:32:51,646 --> 01:32:55,765
But I need the poison you used.

834
01:33:07,846 --> 01:33:14,085
Vasilis... You will take shelter in Yakup.

835
01:33:14,326 --> 01:33:17,045
You will do it with this poison in your hand.

836
01:33:21,046 --> 01:33:23,405
We deceived Osman for years.

837
01:33:23,726 --> 01:33:27,245
Now it's Yakup's turn.

838
01:33:27,606 --> 01:33:29,325
Yakup's turn.

839
01:33:29,486 --> 01:33:33,485
He will convince Yakup
that I allied with Osman, huh?

840
01:33:34,566 --> 01:33:39,045
Good. But we can't do this only with you.

841
01:33:39,246 --> 01:33:44,445
They'll catch a noker.
He will tell the same story.

842
01:33:45,246 --> 01:33:50,125
You both will tell Yakup that Osman came to me.

843
01:33:51,166 --> 01:33:55,885
Then Yakup will have to believe.

844
01:33:57,646 --> 01:34:01,445
They will drown in their own blood.

845
01:34:04,166 --> 01:34:09,405
Mother, I told you I didn't want her
but you brought her to the palace!

846
01:34:09,646 --> 01:34:13,925
I can't, mother! I can't.

847
01:34:16,366 --> 01:34:20,645
You're giving her false hopes.
Don't you care about her feelings?

848
01:34:23,566 --> 01:34:25,885
Mother.

849
01:34:26,886 --> 01:34:30,845
Here... There is someone.

850
01:34:31,406 --> 01:34:35,725
Both my mind and heart say the same.

851
01:34:36,326 --> 01:34:39,365
They say Holofira.

852
01:34:40,206 --> 01:34:41,885
Understand me already.

853
01:34:41,926 --> 01:34:45,285
Enough, Orhan! You aren't a child.

854
01:34:45,286 --> 01:34:50,125
You can't be with Holofira! Your
heart can't see. What about your eyes?

855
01:34:50,126 --> 01:34:53,605
Are they blind too? Is Holofira a Muslim?

856
01:35:03,246 --> 01:35:06,165
What if she becomes a Muslim?

857
01:35:06,966 --> 01:35:10,285
Will you let me then, mother?

858
01:35:10,766 --> 01:35:13,365
You think that's the only problem?

859
01:35:13,446 --> 01:35:17,605
She grew up in luxury. That
girl can't endure hardships.

860
01:35:17,926 --> 01:35:20,685
Would she carry your burden? Tell me.

861
01:35:20,846 --> 01:35:24,685
If you say she would, I will keep quiet then.

862
01:35:27,486 --> 01:35:29,485
What's going on?

863
01:35:32,606 --> 01:35:35,965
We're talking about Orhan's
future marriage, my Bey.

864
01:35:40,646 --> 01:35:43,605
You can talk later.

865
01:35:44,366 --> 01:35:47,005
Make your preparations.

866
01:35:47,526 --> 01:35:50,525
You will lead the best warriors.

867
01:35:51,166 --> 01:35:54,565
We will kill Karacelasun.

868
01:35:55,006 --> 01:35:58,365
-As you order, my Bey.
-Come on.

869
01:36:03,326 --> 01:36:06,205
What is it? You look angry.

870
01:36:06,526 --> 01:36:10,405
As long as Holofira is here,
he won't want another girl.

871
01:36:10,646 --> 01:36:13,925
My hands are tied up. I don't know what to do.

872
01:36:15,006 --> 01:36:19,565
Just be patient. He will see what is right.

873
01:36:19,926 --> 01:36:24,845
I hope so, my Bey. I can't
stand seeing my son suffering.

874
01:36:28,406 --> 01:36:32,365
And this is Shahzade Alaattin's room.

875
01:36:32,606 --> 01:36:36,005
He lets only me go inside.

876
01:36:36,126 --> 01:36:37,565
Yes?

877
01:36:39,526 --> 01:36:42,845
Then you know Scholar's all secrets. Ha, Ghazi?

878
01:36:43,006 --> 01:36:46,045
Of course I do.

879
01:36:47,766 --> 01:36:51,085
You also know, Gonca Hatun.

880
01:36:53,846 --> 01:36:57,525
-I know what?
-My secrets.

881
01:36:57,966 --> 01:37:01,239
-I was just walking around.
When Fatma saw me...

882
01:37:01,251 --> 01:37:03,485
There is nothing
to be a secret.

883
01:37:04,206 --> 01:37:09,125
This is my world. Anyone
curious can look inside.

884
01:37:20,526 --> 01:37:23,725
You read poems. I know that.

885
01:37:24,326 --> 01:37:27,245
Do you write?

886
01:37:28,126 --> 01:37:32,685
I do. I write, but...

887
01:37:32,926 --> 01:37:36,285
...I don't leave them around.

888
01:38:09,926 --> 01:38:15,485
You know what? The daisies I gave you...

889
01:38:17,006 --> 01:38:20,045
-Did you drink?
-No.

890
01:38:20,086 --> 01:38:23,885
-I just threw them away.
-You did?

891
01:38:24,646 --> 01:38:26,725
You threw them away?

892
01:38:28,206 --> 01:38:31,125
That's why your anger still stands here.

893
01:38:31,686 --> 01:38:35,685
During the training, I realized
that you'd have cut me if you could.

894
01:38:35,806 --> 01:38:38,045
I can, but...

895
01:38:38,366 --> 01:38:40,885
But what?

896
01:38:42,046 --> 01:38:44,685
You don't want to hurt me?

897
01:39:06,126 --> 01:39:08,045
Gonca.

898
01:39:08,206 --> 01:39:11,485
I owe you more lives now, Alaattin Bey.

899
01:39:12,486 --> 01:39:16,285
You owe me nothing, Trickster Hatun.

900
01:39:16,486 --> 01:39:20,725
-Only if you didn't call me that.
-What would you do then?

901
01:39:23,606 --> 01:39:26,245
Gonca.

902
01:39:32,206 --> 01:39:35,685
I will tell you something.

903
01:39:38,806 --> 01:39:42,765
-I...
-My Shahzade.

904
01:39:47,446 --> 01:39:49,485
I'm coming.

905
01:39:52,566 --> 01:39:55,165
Excuse me.

906
01:40:01,126 --> 01:40:04,645
My Shahzade, Osman Bey
will go to Karacelasun at dawn.

907
01:40:04,686 --> 01:40:07,285
He wants you to determine the route.

908
01:40:07,566 --> 01:40:11,325
How many people will he go
with? I will draw a route accordingly.

909
01:40:11,846 --> 01:40:16,645
My Bey wants to keep it secret. We'll
be just a few. Nobody should know.

910
01:40:17,086 --> 01:40:19,725
Alright. Let's go.

911
01:40:27,006 --> 01:40:30,005
A night has passed and there
is still no news from Orhan Bey.

912
01:40:30,246 --> 01:40:33,845
I can't stand it anymore. We
need to go as soon as possible.

913
01:40:34,006 --> 01:40:37,125
Holofira.

914
01:40:41,486 --> 01:40:46,365
-What do you want?
-Can we talk in privacy?

915
01:40:51,166 --> 01:40:53,405
I think you got in the wrong way.

916
01:40:53,646 --> 01:40:56,245
If you want halvah, the kitchen is in the back.

917
01:40:56,246 --> 01:40:59,285
Holofira, look.

918
01:40:59,446 --> 01:41:02,165
I'm here to talk about this matter.

919
01:41:02,406 --> 01:41:05,725
I'm all innocent in this matter.

920
01:41:07,046 --> 01:41:10,685
But I don't have much time. If you hear me...

921
01:41:10,726 --> 01:41:12,925
You don't have much time?

922
01:41:13,566 --> 01:41:18,325
You think about me just now,
Orhan? I couldn't sleep all night.

923
01:41:18,966 --> 01:41:21,245
Me neither.

924
01:41:25,006 --> 01:41:28,925
I didn't sleep all night either, Holofira.

925
01:41:33,646 --> 01:41:36,165
I always thought about you.

926
01:41:36,646 --> 01:41:38,965
But I wanted your anger to cool off.

927
01:41:39,126 --> 01:41:41,725
You disappointed me, Orhan.

928
01:41:41,926 --> 01:41:44,525
-When I saw you like that...
-I brought this...

929
01:41:44,686 --> 01:41:47,605
...to heal your wounded heart.

930
01:41:50,366 --> 01:41:52,765
Won't you take it?

931
01:41:54,046 --> 01:41:56,685
Ha?

932
01:42:01,766 --> 01:42:05,645
You think this wound could
be healed with a rose, Orhan?

933
01:42:06,726 --> 01:42:10,605
Alright, I know you
don't want that girl.

934
01:42:11,006 --> 01:42:13,997
-But your mother
doesn't want me either.

935
01:42:14,009 --> 01:42:15,725
If I make things right,

936
01:42:16,086 --> 01:42:18,165
..will you believe me?

937
01:42:18,526 --> 01:42:21,485
Can you convince your mother, Orhan?

938
01:42:21,566 --> 01:42:23,965
If you believe me

939
01:42:24,966 --> 01:42:28,525
...I can overcome all
the difficulties, Holofira.

940
01:42:30,926 --> 01:42:33,925
But I have an important duty now.

941
01:42:34,446 --> 01:42:38,485
A tough one. I may not come back.

942
01:42:39,526 --> 01:42:44,965
But I don't want to leave a
wounded Holofira behind.

943
01:42:46,726 --> 01:42:51,845
Holofira, will you forgive me?

944
01:42:53,566 --> 01:42:56,845
I forgive you for now.

945
01:42:59,526 --> 01:43:03,325
But I will never forgive you if
you don't come back, Orhan.

946
01:43:04,046 --> 01:43:08,285
I will. I promise you.

947
01:43:08,606 --> 01:43:11,245
I will be back, Holofira.

948
01:43:17,406 --> 01:43:20,365
My Shahzade, horses are ready.

949
01:43:31,846 --> 01:43:35,325
Stay safe.

950
01:43:50,686 --> 01:43:53,685
GERM1YANOGLU SIN1RL / PAZAR

951
01:43:54,126 --> 01:43:58,965
It is certain that Bala Hatun is
getting aware of some things.

952
01:43:59,046 --> 01:44:03,445
The things she said that
day inviting you to the feast.

953
01:44:03,526 --> 01:44:06,525
What do you think, Gonca?

954
01:44:06,606 --> 01:44:10,285
Did Alaeddin spoke with his mother?

955
01:44:10,606 --> 01:44:12,965
I don't know.

956
01:44:13,246 --> 01:44:17,365
Bala Hatun is a good person.
She acted good towards me..

957
01:44:17,486 --> 01:44:22,205
-As she did to everyone.
-Alright Gonca, I know you are secretive..

958
01:44:22,286 --> 01:44:26,445
You are doing this for
duty, you know that right?

959
01:44:26,686 --> 01:44:30,685
Tell me, how was the feast.

960
01:44:31,326 --> 01:44:37,365
It was alright. Malhun Hatun
introduced Aysima Hatun to everyone.

961
01:44:37,646 --> 01:44:40,005
Holofira was very upset about it.

962
01:44:40,286 --> 01:44:43,925
She did not show it, however I understood.

963
01:44:44,286 --> 01:44:47,445
How as Alaeddin towards you?

964
01:44:47,806 --> 01:44:51,325
He did everything he
could to find a cure for you.

965
01:44:54,206 --> 01:45:00,485
Gonca, it looks like you're
about to say something to me.

966
01:45:03,046 --> 01:45:06,645
Mother, I've heard something.

967
01:45:07,086 --> 01:45:13,525
Alaeddin Bey is coming!

968
01:45:27,886 --> 01:45:34,165
Whatever, now go. We will talk later.

969
01:45:57,926 --> 01:46:01,165
I've sent the last scout alps, Bayindir Bey.

970
01:46:01,486 --> 01:46:06,645
We will find that Veysel dog before dark.

971
01:46:06,806 --> 01:46:09,965
Inform everyone. The spies in Bursa..

972
01:46:10,206 --> 01:46:12,805
And in Konya.

973
01:46:12,966 --> 01:46:17,125
Look brother. When I catch that dog..

974
01:46:24,046 --> 01:46:27,725
Bey, Veysel has been seen
going to the frontier marketplace.

975
01:46:29,566 --> 01:46:34,725
Alps, to frontier marketplace. Come on.

976
01:46:39,046 --> 01:46:41,765
Veysel.

977
01:46:41,846 --> 01:46:46,645
Come on!

978
01:46:48,366 --> 01:46:52,245
-Are you feeling better?
-Thanks to you, I am alright.

979
01:46:53,686 --> 01:46:56,565
However, you still seem tired.

980
01:46:57,046 --> 01:46:59,885
Gonca Hatun.

981
01:47:01,886 --> 01:47:04,645
I've thought a lot last night.

982
01:47:04,766 --> 01:47:07,765
Not only last night.

983
01:47:08,166 --> 01:47:11,325
I've been thinking for a long time.

984
01:47:12,326 --> 01:47:15,445
But I can not unsolve it.

985
01:47:15,806 --> 01:47:18,885
There is nothing you can not solve.

986
01:47:20,726 --> 01:47:24,245
This is not a wisdom matter.

987
01:47:24,886 --> 01:47:28,285
This is not an issue to be
discussed here as well, however..

988
01:47:29,086 --> 01:47:32,925
What are you saying? I
do not understand, scholar.

989
01:47:33,406 --> 01:47:36,445
-Gonca.
-Yes?

990
01:47:41,006 --> 01:47:44,125
I became sure when I found this.

991
01:47:44,366 --> 01:47:48,765
Both sure of myself, and..

992
01:47:50,246 --> 01:47:53,765
My Shahzade.

993
01:47:59,806 --> 01:48:03,125
Whatever, we can talk later, alright?

994
01:48:03,366 --> 01:48:07,885
-Alright.
-With your permission.

995
01:48:09,526 --> 01:48:12,085
Bayindir Bey.

996
01:48:12,286 --> 01:48:14,805
-My Shahzade.
-You were after Veysel?

997
01:48:15,166 --> 01:48:16,205
Or?

998
01:48:17,686 --> 01:48:21,485
My Shahzade, we've looked
everywhere. Tracks led us here.

999
01:48:21,766 --> 01:48:26,085
-That dog is here.
-You say so?

1000
01:48:26,806 --> 01:48:30,245
We did not come across anyone suspicious.

1001
01:48:30,806 --> 01:48:34,405
What is happening, what are you doing?

1002
01:48:34,966 --> 01:48:39,165
-That Veysel dog.
-Alps, after him!

1003
01:48:45,846 --> 01:48:49,605
Catch him!

1004
01:48:55,766 --> 01:48:59,125
My Shahzade!

1005
01:49:00,286 --> 01:49:03,325
Come on! Catch him!

1006
01:49:20,046 --> 01:49:24,845
Catch him! He is running away!

1007
01:49:40,366 --> 01:49:43,765
You corrupted dog!

1008
01:49:51,166 --> 01:49:53,925
Enough!

1009
01:49:58,006 --> 01:50:00,605
What is this disgrace..

1010
01:50:00,926 --> 01:50:04,165
In my marketplace.

1011
01:50:04,806 --> 01:50:09,685
Alaeddin.

1012
01:50:12,486 --> 01:50:16,165
My Sultan! My Sultan!

1013
01:50:17,246 --> 01:50:20,805
My Sultan!

1014
01:50:20,886 --> 01:50:24,685
There is a grave matter
that I need to tell you.

1015
01:50:26,486 --> 01:50:30,005
Do not let them have me.

1016
01:50:30,406 --> 01:50:33,485
I ask for mercy.

1017
01:50:38,486 --> 01:50:43,605
You were their most trusted
man, Veysel. What happened?

1018
01:50:45,606 --> 01:50:50,405
Mehmed Bey! That dog is a spy!

1019
01:50:50,606 --> 01:50:54,485
He has been eating with us for
so long, now he is betraying us!

1020
01:50:54,566 --> 01:50:56,925
We will take him to Yenisehir.

1021
01:50:57,206 --> 01:51:02,285
Veysel will not go anywhere, Alaeddin Bey.

1022
01:51:06,446 --> 01:51:09,325
It is what Osman Bey ordered, Yakup Bey.

1023
01:51:09,446 --> 01:51:13,365
All orders beyond that is invalid.

1024
01:51:13,566 --> 01:51:17,045
This is Sultan Yakup you are facing, Alaeddin.

1025
01:51:17,246 --> 01:51:19,725
Know your place, then talk.

1026
01:51:19,966 --> 01:51:22,525
There is no need to talk, Mehmed Bey.

1027
01:51:22,646 --> 01:51:26,005
We will take this Veysel dog and leave.

1028
01:51:28,006 --> 01:51:32,005
-Come on alps.
-Alps!

1029
01:51:40,006 --> 01:51:43,565
No one can have the one
who takes shelter among us.

1030
01:51:47,046 --> 01:51:52,565
Sheathe your swords! I said sheathe!

1031
01:52:07,966 --> 01:52:13,965
Alaeddin. I will listen to Veysel first.

1032
01:52:14,526 --> 01:52:18,605
And you will not leave the marketplace.

1033
01:52:19,086 --> 01:52:24,645
I will decide what to do later.

1034
01:52:28,446 --> 01:52:32,205
-Kanyumaz.
-My Sultan.

1035
01:52:32,486 --> 01:52:37,205
-Bring Veysel.
-As you command, my Sultan.

1036
01:53:22,726 --> 01:53:25,245
Alps.

1037
01:53:25,606 --> 01:53:28,405
We will get off horses.

1038
01:53:28,846 --> 01:53:34,325
Because the route Alaeddin showed
tells us so, we will walk from here.

1039
01:53:34,646 --> 01:53:40,405
They won't hear the horses.
Make your preparations.

1040
01:53:46,166 --> 01:53:48,965
-Orhan.
-My Bey.

1041
01:53:49,206 --> 01:53:51,925
Come, son.

1042
01:53:53,046 --> 01:53:57,245
My son, your blood boils.

1043
01:53:57,446 --> 01:54:01,085
You are very eager to be a martyr.

1044
01:54:02,566 --> 01:54:06,925
However, this is not the time.
Your first task is to stay alive.

1045
01:54:07,886 --> 01:54:12,285
And keep your alps alive.

1046
01:54:13,646 --> 01:54:16,365
All of them are the sons of their mothers.

1047
01:54:16,446 --> 01:54:19,685
All of them are entrusted
to you from your father.

1048
01:54:19,726 --> 01:54:21,605
As you command, my Bey.

1049
01:54:22,646 --> 01:54:25,885
For what are we fighting
without taking a breather?

1050
01:54:25,966 --> 01:54:30,845
The dream of a magnificent
state is my heritage from my father.

1051
01:54:31,566 --> 01:54:36,845
And it is a heritage from
my father, to my sons.

1052
01:54:37,006 --> 01:54:41,605
My Bey. Your dream is my dream.

1053
01:54:42,366 --> 01:54:46,525
Your cause is my cause.

1054
01:54:47,886 --> 01:54:51,245
My blood boils, it is true.

1055
01:54:51,406 --> 01:54:54,605
However, we do not have
the lives to give out to dogs.

1056
01:54:54,686 --> 01:54:58,685
And I swear that we will raise..

1057
01:54:59,006 --> 01:55:02,245
The heritage from you with alps, with beys..

1058
01:55:02,366 --> 01:55:08,045
And with brothers, by our own efforts.

1059
01:55:08,246 --> 01:55:14,045
Step by step, life by life, we
will conquer this world, father.

1060
01:55:14,246 --> 01:55:19,845
As you've said before; "This
cause is greater than a lifetime."

1061
01:55:21,846 --> 01:55:27,645
Praise be!
Praise be.

1062
01:55:28,326 --> 01:55:33,245
Thank you, my son. My valiant, come here.

1063
01:55:46,286 --> 01:55:49,245
This is the route.

1064
01:55:51,286 --> 01:55:52,885
All right, my Bey.

1065
01:55:55,326 --> 01:55:57,725
You'll go this way.

1066
01:55:58,526 --> 01:56:02,765
-May your holy war be blessed.
-It is blessed, my Bey.

1067
01:56:03,166 --> 01:56:06,605
Alps, come on.

1068
01:56:28,446 --> 01:56:32,845
Our Shahzade will become a great Bey, my Bey.

1069
01:56:33,126 --> 01:56:36,565
We will be the last of Beys, Boran.

1070
01:56:37,566 --> 01:56:40,885
There will be many Sultans

1071
01:56:41,246 --> 01:56:44,125
from our generation after us.

1072
01:56:44,206 --> 01:56:47,565
-Many Sultans.
-Thank you, my Bey.

1073
01:56:54,806 --> 01:56:58,645
Say it without mumbling. What do you know?

1074
01:56:59,606 --> 01:57:01,885
My Sultan

1075
01:57:02,566 --> 01:57:07,125
The trap that was set against
you and the ambush of Mongols

1076
01:57:10,646 --> 01:57:14,125
were Osman Bey's plans.

1077
01:57:14,526 --> 01:57:17,445
Osman...!

1078
01:57:18,766 --> 01:57:22,205
Just so you get humiliated in front of Beys.

1079
01:57:22,846 --> 01:57:26,485
He did it to make himself look like a hero.

1080
01:57:28,126 --> 01:57:32,725
My Bey, let me...

1081
01:57:36,446 --> 01:57:39,845
Why would we believe you, Veysel?

1082
01:57:40,286 --> 01:57:44,165
Maybe there is another hostility between you.

1083
01:57:44,646 --> 01:57:48,005
And you're slandering because of that.

1084
01:57:48,526 --> 01:57:50,885
You're right, my Sultan.

1085
01:57:51,766 --> 01:57:56,005
But...

1086
01:57:57,526 --> 01:58:01,725
I'll show you something
important. If you let me...

1087
01:58:10,486 --> 01:58:12,565
This poison.

1088
01:58:12,966 --> 01:58:15,925
The poison he applied to the swords.

1089
01:58:20,646 --> 01:58:23,325
Kanyumaz.

1090
01:58:33,926 --> 01:58:37,965
So you're saying that

1091
01:58:38,086 --> 01:58:41,365
he poisoned himself first

1092
01:58:41,806 --> 01:58:45,125
and then found the cure and became the hero?

1093
01:58:45,326 --> 01:58:48,045
The scheme is huge Saadet Hatun.

1094
01:58:50,086 --> 01:58:53,645
Take this to the healer.

1095
01:58:54,126 --> 01:58:57,205
Let him take a look to
see if it's the same poison.

1096
01:58:57,366 --> 01:58:59,845
Yes, my Sultan.

1097
01:59:04,566 --> 01:59:07,245
There's one more thing, my Sultan.

1098
01:59:09,086 --> 01:59:11,485
Osman Bey

1099
01:59:13,246 --> 01:59:16,445
made a deal with Karacelasun.

1100
01:59:16,766 --> 01:59:20,685
They will meet in an inn in the east.

1101
01:59:21,286 --> 01:59:23,125
Fitnat.

1102
01:59:23,486 --> 01:59:28,285
Tell Ulgen to call Gonca.

1103
01:59:40,886 --> 01:59:44,605
If the real scheme was for you to come here...

1104
01:59:44,686 --> 01:59:47,365
...I'll cut your head, Veysel.

1105
01:59:47,446 --> 01:59:51,285
The truth will come out sooner or later.

1106
01:59:53,446 --> 01:59:56,085
Believe me, or

1107
01:59:58,846 --> 02:00:01,685
take my head.

1108
02:00:03,486 --> 02:00:06,765
At least

1109
02:00:06,886 --> 02:00:10,405
I'd be dying with the hands of
someone on the path of Haqq.

1110
02:00:10,646 --> 02:00:13,325
It's not a problem.

1111
02:00:17,086 --> 02:00:21,445
The fact that I haven't been able
to realize their treason all this time

1112
02:00:21,726 --> 02:00:24,885
makes my death justifiable.

1113
02:00:27,566 --> 02:00:31,525
-May I come in, my Bey?
-Come on in.

1114
02:00:32,646 --> 02:00:36,525
My Sultan, nokers were trying to
sneak in around the marketplace,

1115
02:00:36,606 --> 02:00:39,325
the other ones ran away, we caught him.

1116
02:00:51,246 --> 02:00:55,165
Mother, you called me.

1117
02:00:55,406 --> 02:00:57,525
Ulgen, you can leave.

1118
02:00:58,726 --> 02:01:02,765
Why was Alaeddin here?

1119
02:01:06,886 --> 02:01:09,245
We couldn't talk.

1120
02:01:10,206 --> 02:01:14,725
You were about to tell me something
before Alaeddin came, Gonca.

1121
02:01:15,366 --> 02:01:19,805
What happened in the palace? Did
Alaeddin declared his love for you?

1122
02:01:20,886 --> 02:01:24,005
No, mother.

1123
02:01:24,126 --> 02:01:26,485
Why did I want you to approach Alaeddin?

1124
02:01:26,606 --> 02:01:30,605
Why did I send you to that palace?
So that you would learn something.

1125
02:01:31,766 --> 02:01:34,045
What did you learn?

1126
02:01:38,886 --> 02:01:41,485
Osman Bey

1127
02:01:41,846 --> 02:01:45,525
is going to meet with
someone named Karacelasun.

1128
02:01:46,006 --> 02:01:48,765
They are a few people.

1129
02:01:50,246 --> 02:01:53,205
Alaeddin was going to make a route.

1130
02:01:53,326 --> 02:01:55,805
What are you saying, Gonca?

1131
02:01:55,926 --> 02:01:59,125
Then Veysel is right.

1132
02:01:59,646 --> 02:02:01,845
What happened, mother?

1133
02:02:02,486 --> 02:02:05,285
We need to tell this to your father.

1134
02:02:05,366 --> 02:02:06,765
What happened, mother?

1135
02:02:07,286 --> 02:02:09,885
Mother, mother?

1136
02:02:11,406 --> 02:02:15,125
My Allah, what am I going to do?

1137
02:02:15,246 --> 02:02:20,805
My Allah, please help
me. I don't know what to do.

1138
02:02:21,006 --> 02:02:25,485
Osman gave us gold and told us to attack Yakup.

1139
02:02:26,406 --> 02:02:29,885
He will give us the rest of
the gold when the job is done.

1140
02:02:30,526 --> 02:02:33,605
Who did Osman make a deal with?

1141
02:02:36,926 --> 02:02:38,725
With a dastard like you?

1142
02:02:38,806 --> 02:02:41,085
No, he made a deal with

1143
02:02:41,286 --> 02:02:43,485
our commander Karacelasun.

1144
02:02:43,686 --> 02:02:46,005
Now he is with him.

1145
02:02:46,086 --> 02:02:49,605
-May I come in, my Sultan?
-Come on in.

1146
02:02:50,726 --> 02:02:53,805
My Sultan, Veysel is right.

1147
02:02:53,886 --> 02:02:56,365
This is the same poison.

1148
02:03:08,366 --> 02:03:11,405
So you're saying that

1149
02:03:11,806 --> 02:03:14,845
Osman is working with you

1150
02:03:16,446 --> 02:03:18,765
he is giving you money.

1151
02:03:18,846 --> 02:03:21,245
Yes.

1152
02:03:22,886 --> 02:03:26,485
Where is Karacelasun?

1153
02:03:26,566 --> 02:03:30,165
-Let's go there and hear it from him.
-He's in the east,

1154
02:03:30,246 --> 02:03:33,205
...in the inn near Cinarli.

1155
02:03:40,286 --> 02:03:42,525
Alright.

1156
02:03:43,286 --> 02:03:44,845
Alright.

1157
02:04:17,966 --> 02:04:20,805
Veysel.

1158
02:04:23,126 --> 02:04:25,165
Veysel.

1159
02:04:31,286 --> 02:04:35,085
I'll think about the issue first.

1160
02:04:35,926 --> 02:04:39,285
Then I'll make my decision.

1161
02:04:40,566 --> 02:04:43,685
Until then

1162
02:04:43,806 --> 02:04:48,365
Veysel will be our guest in our marketplace.

1163
02:04:50,286 --> 02:04:52,605
Be careful.

1164
02:04:52,806 --> 02:04:55,445
Kayis must not cause a conflict.

1165
02:05:05,166 --> 02:05:09,285
Keep your eyes on this dog.

1166
02:05:14,686 --> 02:05:17,285
Veysel is telling the truth.

1167
02:05:17,406 --> 02:05:21,365
Osman is going to Karacelasun.

1168
02:05:24,486 --> 02:05:27,045
With a few men.

1169
02:05:27,446 --> 02:05:32,405
People do not face their enemies
with a few men on their side.

1170
02:05:33,166 --> 02:05:38,325
They keep it secret.
Apparently he is after something.

1171
02:05:40,686 --> 02:05:43,965
Osman!

1172
02:05:45,966 --> 02:05:48,725
Osman!!

1173
02:06:05,566 --> 02:06:09,125
We poisoned the relationship between them.

1174
02:06:09,726 --> 02:06:14,125
This is important. Osman will
be Yakup's enemy forever now.

1175
02:06:14,206 --> 02:06:16,965
He will kill him sooner or later.

1176
02:06:17,046 --> 02:06:20,685
Soon, they will have their
own blood on their hands.

1177
02:06:22,366 --> 02:06:24,925
Yakup will kill Osman.

1178
02:06:25,086 --> 02:06:27,325
And we will kill the rest.

1179
02:06:27,406 --> 02:06:29,205
The weather is foggy now.

1180
02:06:29,366 --> 02:06:32,485
Fight, fight, fight.

1181
02:06:32,606 --> 02:06:36,125
Fight will change the balance
on these lands, Karacelasun.

1182
02:06:36,206 --> 02:06:40,005
The important thing is that there will be
no power left to stand against us in the end.

1183
02:06:40,286 --> 02:06:42,685
Fight.

1184
02:06:42,766 --> 02:06:47,245
You will keep bringing smokes
until it is not possible to see.

1185
02:06:47,326 --> 02:06:49,445
Don't worry.

1186
02:06:49,926 --> 02:06:52,245
My troops started moving.

1187
02:06:52,326 --> 02:06:54,125
Good..

1188
02:06:54,806 --> 02:06:57,925
Soon, their blood will be shed...

1189
02:06:58,046 --> 02:07:01,405
...for me to take my brother's revenge.

1190
02:07:18,406 --> 02:07:21,045
We will not wait anymore. Come on Alps!

1191
02:07:21,126 --> 02:07:23,525
Alaeddin Bey!

1192
02:07:25,126 --> 02:07:28,965
Don't... Be patient.

1193
02:07:29,086 --> 02:07:33,645
That man is a traitor, Gonca Hatun.
We cannot know what he is going to do.

1194
02:07:33,886 --> 02:07:36,085
My father does not trust him anyway.

1195
02:07:36,206 --> 02:07:39,365
Don't worry. -What if he believes him?

1196
02:07:39,446 --> 02:07:43,365
What if he believes him? Then
won't you regret standing before me?

1197
02:07:43,486 --> 02:07:46,365
Scholar. If I let you go now...

1198
02:07:46,446 --> 02:07:49,165
...will you go and raid my father's tent?

1199
02:07:49,286 --> 02:07:53,085
I cannot let that happen. Understand me.

1200
02:08:00,646 --> 02:08:04,045
My Shahzade. They are leaving.

1201
02:08:11,046 --> 02:08:14,765
Thanks to Allah, Yakup Bey.

1202
02:08:16,126 --> 02:08:19,085
Now give that traitor to us.

1203
02:08:19,446 --> 02:08:23,045
The traitor is your father!

1204
02:08:26,846 --> 02:08:31,285
Don't you mention my father's
name with your dirty tongue!

1205
02:08:32,406 --> 02:08:35,045
Brother! Brother, what are you doing?

1206
02:08:35,126 --> 02:08:37,525
Alaeddin! -Don't..

1207
02:08:37,606 --> 02:08:39,885
Don't... -Alaeddin!

1208
02:08:40,006 --> 02:08:42,445
Alaeddin! Brother!

1209
02:08:42,566 --> 02:08:44,605
Brother! -Enough!

1210
02:08:44,806 --> 02:08:47,725
Brother!

1211
02:08:48,966 --> 02:08:53,845
Alps! Arrest Alaeddin Bey and his Alps.

1212
02:09:01,606 --> 02:09:05,685
Father, don't... Father...

1213
02:09:05,886 --> 02:09:08,765
Father, don't.. -What are you doing, Gonca?

1214
02:09:08,846 --> 02:09:11,085
Mother...

1215
02:09:12,846 --> 02:09:16,605
You are making a mistake, Yakup Bey.

1216
02:09:17,006 --> 02:09:19,405
The man you are standing next to is a traitor!

1217
02:09:19,726 --> 02:09:22,725
You are believing the games of our enemies!

1218
02:09:23,846 --> 02:09:29,965
I am not going to learn what to
do and what not to do from you.

1219
02:09:31,806 --> 02:09:36,605
Yakup Bey! The man behind you
is the traitor we've been looking for!

1220
02:09:36,686 --> 02:09:41,605
Enough! Come on! Arrest them!

1221
02:09:41,766 --> 02:09:44,765
Yakup Bey... Yakup Bey!

1222
02:09:45,166 --> 02:09:49,405
Move, Cerkutay!

1223
02:09:52,486 --> 02:09:54,965
Gonca...

1224
02:09:55,886 --> 02:09:57,645
Don't...

1225
02:09:58,446 --> 02:10:01,525
Don't you feel upset.

1226
02:10:01,606 --> 02:10:04,605
Now those who have mercy in their hearts...

1227
02:10:04,726 --> 02:10:08,485
...cannot be on my side.

1228
02:10:09,606 --> 02:10:12,485
Step back!

1229
02:10:13,566 --> 02:10:17,245
My Shahzade... Order us,
and we will take you out of here.

1230
02:10:17,486 --> 02:10:19,805
They are too crowded, Baysungur.

1231
02:10:19,886 --> 02:10:24,845
We never shed our brothers' blood, and we
will never shed their blood. Do not resist.

1232
02:10:26,086 --> 02:10:29,405
-Kanyumaz. -My Sultan.
-Tell them to prepare our horses.

1233
02:10:29,566 --> 02:10:31,765
Yes my Sultan.

1234
02:10:33,326 --> 02:10:37,405
Let's see if there is betrayal...

1235
02:10:37,726 --> 02:10:40,365
...or not with our own eyes.

1236
02:12:43,646 --> 02:12:45,125
Are we ready, Boran?

1237
02:12:45,137 --> 02:12:47,125
We are my Bey, Biiznillah.

1238
02:12:47,206 --> 02:12:50,365
Alps surrounded the inn.

1239
02:12:50,726 --> 02:12:55,085
But... I don't understand why we
sent our Shahzade in advance, my Bey.

1240
02:12:55,206 --> 02:13:00,445
Our enemies are tough. He must
fight with the tough, so he can be one.

1241
02:13:00,566 --> 02:13:03,965
How can they lead our people if they
cannot lead the Alps and make a raid?

1242
02:13:04,046 --> 02:13:07,525
-Yes, my Bey.
-We will see his talent.

1243
02:13:07,766 --> 02:13:10,885
Now it is our turn.

1244
02:13:28,046 --> 02:13:31,685
What is this noise? Go and check.

1245
02:13:32,726 --> 02:13:36,525
Allah is The Greatest!

1246
02:14:33,366 --> 02:14:36,125
Osman's seed...

1247
02:14:36,206 --> 02:14:39,285
Is your father offering your
head instead of his own head?

1248
02:14:39,366 --> 02:14:40,034
Where is he?

1249
02:14:40,046 --> 02:14:42,085
The sword that took
your brother's head...

1250
02:14:42,326 --> 02:14:45,085
...is offered to you!

1251
02:14:45,246 --> 02:14:47,245
And it will slit your throat!

1252
02:14:47,326 --> 02:14:49,325
Young dog...

1253
02:14:49,846 --> 02:14:51,765
Was your father, the old wolf...

1254
02:14:51,846 --> 02:14:54,405
...afraid to face me?

1255
02:14:57,566 --> 02:15:02,005
He wanted blood to touch
the young wolf's teeth!

1256
02:17:15,924 --> 02:17:19,763
Osman... I was waiting for you.

1257
02:17:19,846 --> 02:17:22,325
So you were waiting for your death, huh?

1258
02:17:22,406 --> 02:17:27,125
Come... Now it is time to take your head.

1259
02:17:27,245 --> 02:17:29,245
Come at me.

1260
02:17:29,486 --> 02:17:31,445
What is this disgrace?

1261
02:17:31,846 --> 02:17:37,325
Did you start fighting when
you were working together?

1262
02:17:37,726 --> 02:17:41,725
What was the thing you could not share?
-Don't worry.

1263
02:17:41,806 --> 02:17:45,084
It will be done here.

1264
02:17:45,646 --> 02:17:48,405
Your end...

1265
02:17:48,966 --> 02:17:51,763
...has come just like him, Osman.

1266
02:17:52,646 --> 02:17:55,205
I know the traps
you set for me...

1267
02:17:55,446 --> 02:17:58,485
...the things you did with this dog...

1268
02:17:58,566 --> 02:18:00,029
...and everything you did!

1269
02:18:00,040 --> 02:18:01,843
What are you saying, Yakup Bey?

1270
02:18:02,046 --> 02:18:05,763
Huh? -Osman...

1271
02:18:08,004 --> 02:18:11,365
You sold me out to Yakup Bey, huh?

1272
02:18:13,646 --> 02:18:16,525
I thought we were going to work together.

1273
02:18:16,526 --> 02:18:17,683
What?!

1274
02:18:17,924 --> 02:18:18,965
Alps!

1275
02:18:30,498 --> 02:18:42,628
